1
00:00:27,778 --> 00:00:32,488
<i>Long ago, back when the concept</i>
<i>of shinobi did not exist...</i>

2
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:35,525
<i>A certain person bit into</i>
<i>the forbidden fruit</i>

3
00:00:35,577 --> 00:00:37,443
<i>and obtained the power of chakra,</i>

4
00:00:37,913 --> 00:00:40,075
<i>and tried to end</i>
<i>the age of violence.</i>

5
00:00:40,707 --> 00:00:42,448
<i>However, in time,</i>

6
00:00:42,501 --> 00:00:44,788
<i>they became obsessed</i>
<i>with power.</i>

7
00:00:45,963 --> 00:00:51,709
<i>To maintain order in this world,</i>
<i>does one need power...or love?</i>

8
00:00:53,345 --> 00:00:57,634
<i>This conflict would</i>
<i>spark a long war</i>

9
00:00:57,683 --> 00:01:01,472
<i>that continued through into</i>
<i>the generations that followed.</i>

10
00:02:09,963 --> 00:02:13,297
If you're the Hyuga girl,
show us your Byakugan!

11
00:02:13,634 --> 00:02:15,921
If you don't want to,
then don't look our way!

12
00:02:16,094 --> 00:02:18,335
Your eyes are creepy!

13
00:02:18,472 --> 00:02:20,429
I bet you're actually
a monster, right?

14
00:02:20,474 --> 00:02:22,681
Yeah, you Byakugan monster!

15
00:02:28,607 --> 00:02:29,722
Hey! Cut it out!

16
00:02:31,443 --> 00:02:33,150
- Huh?
- Who are you?

17
00:02:34,738 --> 00:02:35,853
I'm Naruto Uzumaki!

18
00:02:36,281 --> 00:02:37,863
The future Hokage!

19
00:02:38,283 --> 00:02:40,149
The future Hokage?

20
00:02:40,327 --> 00:02:41,943
Are you stupid?

21
00:02:41,995 --> 00:02:44,487
Get ready! Kage Bunshin no Jutsu!
(Shadow Clone Jutsu)

22
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:51,502
Come at me!

23
00:02:51,630 --> 00:02:52,665
Yeah!

24
00:02:59,221 --> 00:03:00,211
Why you!

25
00:03:07,521 --> 00:03:09,182
I knocked him out!

26
00:03:09,439 --> 00:03:11,305
Future Hokage, yeah right!

27
00:03:11,733 --> 00:03:13,189
- Wearing a red scarf...
- Yahoo!

28
00:03:13,235 --> 00:03:15,021
Thinking it makes him look cool!

29
00:03:19,908 --> 00:03:21,398
Hold it, hold it!

30
00:03:21,618 --> 00:03:24,235
This time,
I'll do a super-duper jutsu and—?

31
00:03:26,206 --> 00:03:27,617
<i>Ow...</i>

32
00:03:27,666 --> 00:03:29,623
Are you okay?

33
00:03:30,627 --> 00:03:32,209
It's nothing...

34
00:03:33,338 --> 00:03:35,545
Your scarf... Those boys...

35
00:03:38,510 --> 00:03:39,716
I'm sorry...

36
00:03:39,886 --> 00:03:40,921
Don't worry about it.

37
00:03:44,015 --> 00:03:45,380
U...Um...

38
00:03:45,559 --> 00:03:46,549
Huh?

39
00:03:46,893 --> 00:03:50,306
Th... Thank you very much.

40
00:03:52,065 --> 00:03:53,055
See ya!

41
00:04:08,832 --> 00:04:12,575
If the world were to
end tomorrow,

42
00:04:12,669 --> 00:04:14,376
who would you like to
spend your last day with?

43
00:04:14,713 --> 00:04:17,671
Like that would happen!

44
00:04:17,883 --> 00:04:21,467
Just suppose the moon
began to fall...

45
00:04:21,678 --> 00:04:23,544
If it's the end of the world,

46
00:04:23,597 --> 00:04:26,464
I wish meat would fall
instead of the moon!

47
00:04:28,894 --> 00:04:32,262
If the moon begins to fall,
I'll protect you.

48
00:04:32,314 --> 00:04:35,272
I don't need your protection.

49
00:04:37,986 --> 00:04:41,775
Write down who you'd want to
spend the last day on Earth with.

50
00:04:43,742 --> 00:04:45,232
<i>I'm stumped.</i>

51
00:04:46,119 --> 00:04:49,987
<i>I don't know my dad...or my mom...</i>

52
00:04:50,749 --> 00:04:52,410
<i>I don't have any friends...</i>

53
00:05:00,592 --> 00:05:01,707
Hey, Naruto!

54
00:05:01,885 --> 00:05:03,216
Don't throw out your paper!

55
00:05:03,345 --> 00:05:07,509
But there's no way
the world's gonna end!

56
00:05:07,808 --> 00:05:10,516
I'm just saying "if" it does.

57
00:05:11,019 --> 00:05:12,601
Well, it ain't gonna happen.

58
00:05:58,733 --> 00:06:00,349
This is a celestial decree...

59
00:06:01,069 --> 00:06:04,027
A celestial decree upon
the Hyuga Clan.

60
00:06:04,990 --> 00:06:07,027
I will ask you one last time.

61
00:06:08,034 --> 00:06:10,947
Answer me, Hiashi Hyuga.

62
00:06:11,872 --> 00:06:15,240
The answer, which will decide
the future of your clan.

63
00:06:16,001 --> 00:06:17,537
This is the Hyuga's...

64
00:06:18,712 --> 00:06:19,702
reply!

65
00:06:19,796 --> 00:06:20,786
You fool...

66
00:07:09,930 --> 00:07:12,422
I'm your guest lecturer today!

67
00:07:12,724 --> 00:07:15,386
I'm gonna demonstrate some moves,
so pay close attention!

68
00:07:22,025 --> 00:07:24,687
- Naruto Senpai!
- Naruto Senpai!

69
00:07:29,783 --> 00:07:32,525
I never expected him to become
such high stakes material...

70
00:07:32,577 --> 00:07:36,366
- Did you just say steak?
- High stakes! Popular with girls!

71
00:07:36,581 --> 00:07:39,289
His efforts in the war
two years ago...

72
00:07:39,376 --> 00:07:41,287
turned him into the village hero.

73
00:07:41,378 --> 00:07:42,584
Yeah.

74
00:07:46,091 --> 00:07:47,877
Thank you very much.

75
00:07:52,597 --> 00:07:54,133
All right, eat up!

76
00:07:54,224 --> 00:07:55,965
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

77
00:07:56,434 --> 00:07:57,595
Big Brother Naruto!

78
00:07:57,811 --> 00:07:59,267
Hey, Konohamaru.

79
00:07:59,604 --> 00:08:01,641
I have something to show you.

80
00:08:02,023 --> 00:08:04,731
- What is it?
- It's Grandfather Hiruzen's stuff.

81
00:08:04,943 --> 00:08:07,184
I found it during spring cleaning.

82
00:08:08,196 --> 00:08:09,561
Hey, is this...

83
00:08:09,614 --> 00:08:11,355
Don't you dare call them junk.

84
00:08:11,616 --> 00:08:13,653
They're really precious.

85
00:08:13,702 --> 00:08:16,865
- These are...
- They're...not junk!

86
00:08:20,583 --> 00:08:21,539
HYUGA

87
00:08:36,891 --> 00:08:38,677
I'm Naruto Uzumaki!

88
00:08:44,315 --> 00:08:52,854
RINNE FESTIVAL

89
00:08:45,025 --> 00:08:46,436
Time sure flies.

90
00:08:46,484 --> 00:08:49,602
Sales for the Rinne Festival
have already started.

91
00:08:50,572 --> 00:08:51,812
Naruto Senpai!

92
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:53,230
Huh?

93
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:55,861
Please accept
my Rinne Festival present!

94
00:08:56,036 --> 00:08:57,492
Huh? For me?

95
00:08:57,662 --> 00:08:58,993
I'm always cheering for you!

96
00:08:59,664 --> 00:09:00,654
I made it myself!

97
00:09:00,999 --> 00:09:02,831
- Please accept it!
- Please accept it!

98
00:09:02,876 --> 00:09:05,243
H...Hey, thanks!

99
00:09:06,171 --> 00:09:07,707
Thank you.

100
00:09:09,049 --> 00:09:10,039
Hinata...

101
00:09:11,134 --> 00:09:12,499
Oh, Sakura.

102
00:09:12,552 --> 00:09:14,008
Hmm? Knitting something?

103
00:09:14,554 --> 00:09:15,840
That's a surprise.

104
00:09:16,931 --> 00:09:18,467
I'm making a scarf.

105
00:09:18,683 --> 00:09:20,299
Hmm...

106
00:09:20,852 --> 00:09:22,342
W...What is it?

107
00:09:22,395 --> 00:09:23,726
Give it your all, okay?

108
00:09:23,772 --> 00:09:25,058
Huh?

109
00:09:25,482 --> 00:09:28,270
It's a present for him, right?

110
00:09:37,035 --> 00:09:39,743
He's been really popular...lately.

111
00:09:39,829 --> 00:09:41,695
Oh...really?

112
00:09:43,833 --> 00:09:45,824
They come from other villages

113
00:09:45,877 --> 00:09:48,039
to take pictures of him.

114
00:09:48,421 --> 00:09:49,661
Oh...

115
00:09:50,131 --> 00:09:51,838
Don't say "oh."

116
00:09:52,342 --> 00:09:54,083
Hurry up and finish that scarf!

117
00:09:54,552 --> 00:09:56,213
O...Okay...

118
00:09:56,638 --> 00:09:58,003
Come on!

119
00:09:58,098 --> 00:10:00,089
Have more confidence!

120
00:10:00,308 --> 00:10:01,423
Be bold!

121
00:10:02,102 --> 00:10:03,934
O...Okay...

122
00:10:29,546 --> 00:10:31,002
It looks a little big...

123
00:10:33,258 --> 00:10:34,293
All done!

124
00:10:35,885 --> 00:10:37,467
<i>I put my heart and soul into it.</i>

125
00:10:38,012 --> 00:10:40,845
<i>I'm sure my feelings</i>
<i>will reach Naruto.</i>

126
00:10:45,895 --> 00:10:47,431
<i>But will they?</i>

127
00:10:48,273 --> 00:10:49,479
<i>It's already late.</i>

128
00:10:49,858 --> 00:10:51,474
<i>Maybe tomorrow's better...</i>

129
00:10:53,444 --> 00:10:55,230
<i>Nope, I'll give it to him tonight.</i>

130
00:10:56,239 --> 00:10:57,855
<i>Maybe tomorrow...</i>

131
00:10:58,575 --> 00:10:59,861
<i>No, tonight!</i>

132
00:11:00,702 --> 00:11:02,613
<i>No, tomorrow's...</i>

133
00:11:06,541 --> 00:11:08,657
Just hurry up and
tell him how you feel.

134
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:11,831
Hanabi...

135
00:11:11,963 --> 00:11:14,045
Why didn't you say
you were here?

136
00:11:14,132 --> 00:11:16,965
Watching a girl
agonize over love is fun.

137
00:11:17,635 --> 00:11:19,626
That's no way for a child to talk.

138
00:11:19,971 --> 00:11:21,211
I'm not a child.

139
00:11:21,598 --> 00:11:25,091
My Byakugan's perception is
as good as any grown-up.

140
00:11:25,852 --> 00:11:27,013
Anyway...look.

141
00:11:27,562 --> 00:11:28,552
Isn't it cute?

142
00:11:29,147 --> 00:11:31,013
Treating your kunai
like a toy again...

143
00:11:34,569 --> 00:11:35,809
He'll burst out laughing

144
00:11:35,862 --> 00:11:38,149
if your tummy growls while
you're confessing your love.

145
00:11:38,281 --> 00:11:40,522
I'm not going to confess anything!

146
00:11:41,868 --> 00:11:43,324
Rather than giving him a scarf,

147
00:11:43,369 --> 00:11:45,155
maybe you should make yourself
look more fashionable.

148
00:11:47,582 --> 00:11:49,243
The moon is falling?

149
00:11:49,584 --> 00:11:52,372
The moon is clearly
getting closer to Earth.

150
00:11:52,545 --> 00:11:54,536
Is that why there have been
more meteorites lately?

151
00:11:54,964 --> 00:11:56,045
I'll explain.

152
00:11:56,633 --> 00:11:59,375
Gravity will pull together
two celestial bodies

153
00:11:59,427 --> 00:12:01,885
as they near one another.

154
00:12:02,555 --> 00:12:04,796
Once a certain distance is reached,

155
00:12:04,849 --> 00:12:06,806
the moon's surface will
begin to break apart.

156
00:12:07,352 --> 00:12:10,310
I believe a part of the surface
has begun to fall to Earth.

157
00:12:10,647 --> 00:12:11,887
And what will happen?

158
00:12:12,190 --> 00:12:13,726
The moon will
completely disintegrate...

159
00:12:14,108 --> 00:12:16,395
And its fragments will rain
over the Earth's surface.

160
00:12:17,528 --> 00:12:19,018
If nothing is done, mankind will...

161
00:12:20,865 --> 00:12:22,196
Perish...

162
00:12:22,742 --> 00:12:24,232
Is this a natural phenomenon?

163
00:12:24,619 --> 00:12:26,610
Or is this a man-made assault?

164
00:12:26,996 --> 00:12:29,579
That's a good question.

165
00:12:36,297 --> 00:12:38,914
It's getting to be the season
when ramen really hits the spot.

166
00:12:39,467 --> 00:12:42,255
You only eat ramen all year long.

167
00:12:42,512 --> 00:12:44,378
You really like ramen, don't you?

168
00:12:44,555 --> 00:12:46,421
Yup, I love it.

169
00:12:47,225 --> 00:12:48,932
Five more orders of gyoza!

170
00:12:49,185 --> 00:12:50,675
- Coming right up!
- Five orders?

171
00:12:50,728 --> 00:12:52,310
I can't eat that much.

172
00:12:52,605 --> 00:12:53,686
Then don't have any!

173
00:12:54,482 --> 00:12:55,472
Time to dig in!

174
00:12:57,026 --> 00:12:58,232
Can't get this dirty.

175
00:12:59,195 --> 00:13:00,481
Hey, that scarf...

176
00:13:00,571 --> 00:13:01,606
Oh, Hinata!

177
00:13:02,115 --> 00:13:03,856
Join us if you haven't eaten!

178
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,531
It's on me tonight!

179
00:13:06,244 --> 00:13:09,782
He said something made him happy
and he wants to celebrate.

180
00:13:10,790 --> 00:13:12,372
B...But...

181
00:13:12,667 --> 00:13:17,036
Don't be shy. Come and sit here.

182
00:13:17,213 --> 00:13:18,374
Join us, Hinata.

183
00:13:19,966 --> 00:13:21,001
O...Okay...

184
00:13:22,844 --> 00:13:24,334
Naruto Senpai!

185
00:13:24,762 --> 00:13:26,127
Hey, it's you guys.

186
00:13:26,848 --> 00:13:28,464
Thanks for the presents
the other day.

187
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:33,681
Order whatever you want.

188
00:13:34,105 --> 00:13:35,311
It's my treat...
My thanks for the presents.

189
00:13:35,690 --> 00:13:37,021
- Thank you so much!
- Thank you so much!

190
00:13:37,275 --> 00:13:38,640
Hinata, order what you want too.

191
00:13:38,860 --> 00:13:40,771
- Over here, Senpai!
- Huh?

192
00:13:41,112 --> 00:13:42,443
Let's eat together.

193
00:13:43,406 --> 00:13:44,441
Hinata?

194
00:13:44,866 --> 00:13:45,856
What's wrong?

195
00:13:46,617 --> 00:13:49,735
I'm sorry.
Actually, I'm quite full.

196
00:13:49,787 --> 00:13:51,573
- Huh?
- Hinata!

197
00:13:53,291 --> 00:13:54,281
Why don't you walk her home?

198
00:13:54,792 --> 00:13:56,874
Walk Hinata home?

199
00:13:57,378 --> 00:13:58,413
<i>Why?</i>

200
00:13:59,297 --> 00:14:00,287
Well...

201
00:14:00,631 --> 00:14:02,292
- You can't let a young girl walk home alone.
- Order up... Gyoza!

202
00:14:02,342 --> 00:14:03,332
- You can't let a young girl walk home alone.
- Thank you!

203
00:14:03,426 --> 00:14:05,838
Huh? Hinata's really strong.

204
00:14:06,262 --> 00:14:08,003
No one in the village would
dare mess with her.

205
00:14:08,306 --> 00:14:09,296
Hey!

206
00:14:09,474 --> 00:14:10,464
Hinata!

207
00:14:10,767 --> 00:14:12,303
- Oh, you're such an idiot!
- Huh?

208
00:14:13,144 --> 00:14:14,851
Why'd you call me an idiot?

209
00:14:14,979 --> 00:14:17,016
Senpai, the gyoza are ready!

210
00:14:17,315 --> 00:14:18,305
Let's eat!

211
00:14:20,151 --> 00:14:22,688
He can be so dense.

212
00:14:23,363 --> 00:14:25,695
You were going to give him
the scarf, weren't you?

213
00:14:26,407 --> 00:14:27,397
Uh-huh...

214
00:14:28,117 --> 00:14:31,326
You can do it, Hinata.
Be confident.

215
00:14:32,330 --> 00:14:33,320
Thanks...

216
00:14:33,539 --> 00:14:36,031
But how come
you're encouraging me so much?

217
00:14:36,209 --> 00:14:38,371
Huh? Well...

218
00:14:46,344 --> 00:14:47,584
We need to support each other!

219
00:14:48,012 --> 00:14:49,047
Support each other?

220
00:14:52,392 --> 00:15:03,315
HYUGA

221
00:15:33,391 --> 00:15:34,426
Who's there?!

222
00:15:41,023 --> 00:15:42,013
That's Hanabi!

223
00:15:42,483 --> 00:15:43,473
Chōjū Giga! (Super Beast Scroll)

224
00:16:04,130 --> 00:16:05,165
Naruto...

225
00:16:06,132 --> 00:16:10,968
I've always gazed at your back.

226
00:16:13,055 --> 00:16:15,342
But from now on, I want to always...

227
00:16:16,142 --> 00:16:18,099
always stand by your side.

228
00:16:19,562 --> 00:16:23,180
So I knitted this
with all my heart...

229
00:16:24,775 --> 00:16:28,484
Please...accept my feelings!

230
00:16:32,283 --> 00:16:34,024
All right... One more time!

231
00:16:35,870 --> 00:16:36,860
Naruto...

232
00:16:37,914 --> 00:16:38,904
Hinata?!

233
00:16:42,043 --> 00:16:44,080
Good evening...

234
00:16:45,296 --> 00:16:47,003
We saw each other earlier
at Ichiraku.

235
00:16:47,256 --> 00:16:48,496
Oh, that's right!

236
00:16:51,260 --> 00:16:52,250
What's the matter?

237
00:16:54,138 --> 00:16:55,720
Th... That's a nice scarf!

238
00:16:57,391 --> 00:16:59,177
Oh, yeah...

239
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:04,596
Hey, sounds like you're hungry.

240
00:17:05,233 --> 00:17:07,019
If you don't mind instant ramen,
I have some in my room.

241
00:17:07,109 --> 00:17:08,190
Good night!

242
00:17:08,277 --> 00:17:09,267
Huh?

243
00:17:09,445 --> 00:17:11,527
Didn't you want to talk to me?

244
00:17:12,156 --> 00:17:13,521
Hey, Hinata!

245
00:17:21,916 --> 00:17:23,748
I wonder who gave it to him...

246
00:17:26,587 --> 00:17:29,045
I'm happy for you, Naruto.

247
00:17:36,347 --> 00:17:37,633
Why are you crying?

248
00:17:39,725 --> 00:17:41,432
You're getting the scarf wet.

249
00:17:42,603 --> 00:17:44,560
I don't...need it anymore.

250
00:17:45,523 --> 00:17:47,639
Then I'll take it.

251
00:17:49,277 --> 00:17:50,392
Who are you?

252
00:17:51,862 --> 00:17:55,355
I'm Toneri. I've come for you...

253
00:17:56,325 --> 00:17:57,440
Come for me?

254
00:18:02,415 --> 00:18:04,907
- Hinata!
- What?! Let me go!

255
00:18:07,336 --> 00:18:09,794
Hey you!
What're you doing to Hinata?!

256
00:18:24,729 --> 00:18:26,345
Tajū Kage Bunshin no Jutsu!
(Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu)

257
00:18:37,908 --> 00:18:38,898
Hinata!

258
00:19:11,942 --> 00:19:13,148
Rasen Shuriken!

259
00:19:20,368 --> 00:19:21,483
Why you—!

260
00:19:21,577 --> 00:19:22,612
Let Hinata go!

261
00:19:24,914 --> 00:19:25,904
Hold it!

262
00:19:40,513 --> 00:19:42,049
Hinata! Are you okay?!

263
00:19:42,807 --> 00:19:43,797
Uh-huh...

264
00:19:54,568 --> 00:19:55,774
Rasengan!

265
00:20:05,287 --> 00:20:06,903
My body is going numb...

266
00:20:07,373 --> 00:20:08,454
My strength...

267
00:20:21,011 --> 00:20:22,046
Hinata!

268
00:20:28,519 --> 00:20:31,307
Your scarf's...ruined.

269
00:20:32,648 --> 00:20:33,638
Yes...

270
00:20:33,899 --> 00:20:35,856
Where'd those shinobi come from?

271
00:20:36,610 --> 00:20:37,691
I don't know...

272
00:20:42,450 --> 00:20:44,111
The final day is approaching...

273
00:20:45,161 --> 00:20:46,151
Before that...

274
00:20:46,203 --> 00:20:47,238
You bastard!

275
00:20:49,498 --> 00:20:52,456
Before that day,
I will come for you...

276
00:20:53,711 --> 00:20:54,746
Hinata.

277
00:21:19,820 --> 00:21:20,810
What is that?

278
00:21:36,545 --> 00:21:37,785
W...What's going on?!

279
00:21:52,603 --> 00:21:54,344
The Earth...

280
00:21:56,524 --> 00:21:57,889
...Will be destroyed soon.

281
00:22:07,243 --> 00:22:08,483
Your mission is to...

282
00:22:08,953 --> 00:22:10,864
rescue Hanabi Hyuga
who has been kidnapped.

283
00:22:11,455 --> 00:22:13,037
You'll be working as a 4-man team
led by Shikamaru.

284
00:22:13,582 --> 00:22:16,825
I'm also granting Hinata's wish
to be included on this team.

285
00:22:17,378 --> 00:22:18,493
Thank you very much.

286
00:22:18,796 --> 00:22:20,161
Shikamaru, put your hand out.

287
00:22:20,256 --> 00:22:21,246
Huh?

288
00:22:21,298 --> 00:22:22,333
<i>Why?</i>

289
00:22:27,388 --> 00:22:28,378
What's this?

290
00:22:28,472 --> 00:22:31,510
A top secret clock that only
the Five Kage possess.

291
00:22:32,142 --> 00:22:34,008
What kind of clock is it?

292
00:22:34,353 --> 00:22:36,970
It's counting down the time
until Earth's destruction.

293
00:22:38,399 --> 00:22:39,560
I don't get it.

294
00:22:39,984 --> 00:22:42,521
Why's this necessary
for Hanabi's rescue?

295
00:22:43,195 --> 00:22:44,811
Toneri,
the one who kidnapped Hanabi,

296
00:22:44,864 --> 00:22:46,980
could be the one
manipulating the moon.

297
00:22:47,199 --> 00:22:48,405
What are you basing this on?

298
00:22:49,743 --> 00:22:51,734
It's just a hunch.

299
00:22:57,084 --> 00:22:58,119
It was around here

300
00:22:58,168 --> 00:23:00,034
that I lost sight of
Hanabi's kidnapper.

301
00:23:00,880 --> 00:23:02,712
Let's split up
and search for clues.

302
00:23:03,757 --> 00:23:05,714
Naruto, take care of Hinata.

303
00:23:06,176 --> 00:23:07,166
Leave it to me.

304
00:23:15,895 --> 00:23:16,885
What is it?

305
00:23:17,479 --> 00:23:18,560
Oh, nothing.

306
00:23:23,652 --> 00:23:25,017
- Oh!
- What is it?

307
00:23:34,872 --> 00:23:36,112
It's Hanabi's kunai.

308
00:23:42,588 --> 00:23:45,080
Huh? You brought the scarf?

309
00:23:45,215 --> 00:23:46,205
Huh?

310
00:23:46,884 --> 00:23:49,546
Why aren't you using it?
Aren't you cold?

311
00:23:50,971 --> 00:23:52,177
I...I'm fine!

312
00:23:53,599 --> 00:23:56,967
Anyways, we'd better hurry and
let Shikamaru and the others know.

313
00:23:57,394 --> 00:23:58,634
Oh yeah, you're right.

314
00:24:03,734 --> 00:24:05,600
What do you see, Hinata?

315
00:24:06,278 --> 00:24:08,645
There's a spring that's glowing
at the bottom of the cave.

316
00:24:09,239 --> 00:24:10,479
A spring that's glowing?

317
00:24:12,117 --> 00:24:14,700
That shinobi letter is "A"
as in Aun.

318
00:24:15,037 --> 00:24:17,028
It could mean
"this is the beginning."

319
00:24:17,414 --> 00:24:19,951
Hinata, what can you see
at the bottom of the spring?

320
00:24:20,209 --> 00:24:21,950
My vision is distorted...

321
00:24:22,086 --> 00:24:23,542
Your Byakugan is distorting?

322
00:24:24,088 --> 00:24:25,294
We'll just have to go down and see.

323
00:24:26,131 --> 00:24:28,293
Whoa, I can't get this wet.

324
00:24:28,467 --> 00:24:29,673
You're so particular.

325
00:24:30,427 --> 00:24:32,293
What's the big deal
if your scarf gets wet?

326
00:24:32,638 --> 00:24:35,380
It's a big deal.
This means a lot to me.

327
00:24:35,516 --> 00:24:36,506
Huh?!

328
00:24:36,809 --> 00:24:38,800
There's no need to
take the scarf off.

329
00:24:40,229 --> 00:24:42,345
I touched this water
and I didn't get wet.

330
00:25:13,595 --> 00:25:17,304
<i>If the world were</i>
<i>to end tomorrow,</i>

331
00:25:17,349 --> 00:25:19,135
<i>who would you like to</i>
<i>spend your last day with?</i>

332
00:25:19,435 --> 00:25:22,018
<i>Like that would happen!</i>

333
00:25:22,312 --> 00:25:25,680
<i>Just suppose the moon</i>
<i>began to fall...</i>

334
00:25:26,358 --> 00:25:28,065
<i>If it's the end of the world,</i>

335
00:25:28,152 --> 00:25:30,894
<i>I wish meat would fall</i>
<i>instead of the moon!</i>

336
00:25:35,993 --> 00:25:36,983
<i>Look! The moon!</i>

337
00:25:37,036 --> 00:25:38,026
<i>Huh?</i>

338
00:25:40,664 --> 00:25:44,783
NINJA ACADEMY

339
00:25:50,507 --> 00:25:51,838
<i>The match-up for Round 7!</i>

340
00:25:53,719 --> 00:25:54,959
<i>Naruto Uzumaki versus...</i>

341
00:25:55,179 --> 00:25:56,214
<i>Kiba Inuzuka!</i>

342
00:25:57,514 --> 00:25:59,300
<i>This is the Chunin Exam?</i>

343
00:25:59,516 --> 00:26:00,506
<i>Naruto!</i>

344
00:26:00,559 --> 00:26:02,641
<i>Don't you dare lose</i>
<i>to a guy like him!</i>

345
00:26:03,645 --> 00:26:05,682
<i>Gijū Ninpō! (Ninja Art! Beast Mimicry!)</i>
<i>Shikyaku no Jutsu! (All-Fours Jutsu)</i>

346
00:26:05,856 --> 00:26:06,846
<i>Wait a minute!</i>

347
00:26:06,899 --> 00:26:07,889
<i>Here I come!</i>

348
00:26:10,986 --> 00:26:12,727
<i>Stop it, Kiba...!</i>

349
00:26:16,700 --> 00:26:19,818
<i>Naruto is fighting Pain right now!</i>

350
00:26:21,246 --> 00:26:23,578
<i>Naruto is fighting alone...</i>

351
00:26:25,209 --> 00:26:26,745
<i>Banshō Ten’in! (Universal Pull)</i>

352
00:26:32,674 --> 00:26:33,835
<i>Naruto...</i>

353
00:26:44,645 --> 00:26:45,726
<i>Naruto...</i>

354
00:26:47,731 --> 00:26:48,721
<i>What is it?</i>

355
00:26:48,899 --> 00:26:49,980
<i>It's ointment.</i>

356
00:26:50,609 --> 00:26:51,599
<i>Why're you giving it to me?</i>

357
00:26:52,778 --> 00:26:54,735
<i>Just accept it...Naruto.</i>

358
00:26:56,573 --> 00:26:59,440
<i>Thanks. You're nice, Hinata.</i>

359
00:27:00,494 --> 00:27:02,030
<i>Banshō Ten’in.</i>

360
00:27:19,138 --> 00:27:21,800
<i>I guess I'll be taking you now...</i>

361
00:27:28,063 --> 00:27:29,679
<i>Why'd you come out here?!</i>

362
00:27:30,023 --> 00:27:31,354
<i>You're no match...</i>

363
00:27:32,568 --> 00:27:33,558
<i>This time...</i>

364
00:27:33,694 --> 00:27:35,605
<i>I'm going to save you, Naruto.</i>

365
00:27:36,738 --> 00:27:39,651
<i>I was always crying,</i>
<i>and giving up before even trying.</i>

366
00:27:40,242 --> 00:27:42,483
<i>I made so many wrong turns...</i>

367
00:27:43,912 --> 00:27:47,655
<i>But you helped me find my way</i>
<i>and take the correct path, Naruto.</i>

368
00:27:49,251 --> 00:27:50,958
<i>I always chased after you.</i>

369
00:27:51,879 --> 00:27:53,335
<i>I wanted to catch up to you.</i>

370
00:27:55,215 --> 00:27:58,173
<i>I wanted to walk</i>
<i>beside you all the time.</i>

371
00:27:58,802 --> 00:28:00,543
<i>I want to be at your side, always.</i>

372
00:28:02,139 --> 00:28:04,096
<i>You changed me, Naruto!</i>

373
00:28:05,767 --> 00:28:08,475
<i>Your smile is what saved me!</i>

374
00:28:10,314 --> 00:28:12,806
<i>That's why I'm not afraid to die...</i>

375
00:28:13,609 --> 00:28:15,225
<i>if it means I can protect you!</i>

376
00:28:21,033 --> 00:28:22,023
<i>Because...</i>

377
00:28:22,576 --> 00:28:25,113
<i>I love you, Naruto!</i>

378
00:28:29,833 --> 00:28:30,868
<i>Hinata...</i>

379
00:28:31,543 --> 00:28:35,286
<i>If the world were to end tomorrow,</i>

380
00:28:35,339 --> 00:28:37,046
<i>who would you like to</i>
<i>spend your last day with?</i>

381
00:28:37,799 --> 00:28:39,585
<i>If it's the end of the world,</i>

382
00:28:39,676 --> 00:28:42,384
<i>I wish meat would fall</i>
<i>instead of the moon!</i>

383
00:28:44,640 --> 00:28:46,381
<i>Not Iruka Sensei again...</i>

384
00:28:49,645 --> 00:28:53,479
<i>Write down who you'd want to</i>
<i>spend your last day on Earth with.</i>

385
00:28:56,318 --> 00:28:57,308
<i>Hey, Naruto!</i>

386
00:28:57,778 --> 00:28:59,064
<i>Don't throw out your paper!</i>

387
00:28:59,363 --> 00:29:02,981
<i>But there's no way</i>
<i>the world's gonna end!</i>

388
00:29:03,033 --> 00:29:06,242
<i>I'm just saying "if" it does.</i>

389
00:29:06,328 --> 00:29:08,160
<i>Well, it ain't gonna happen.</i>

390
00:29:18,548 --> 00:29:22,041
NARUTO UZUMAKI

391
00:29:22,219 --> 00:29:23,926
<i>Huh? Me?</i>

392
00:29:24,721 --> 00:29:26,587
<i>Na...ruto...</i>

393
00:29:28,308 --> 00:29:29,298
<i>What is it?</i>

394
00:29:29,726 --> 00:29:30,761
<i>It's ointment.</i>

395
00:29:31,186 --> 00:29:32,301
<i>Why're you giving it to me?</i>

396
00:29:32,729 --> 00:29:34,060
<i>- So dense!</i>
<i>- Huh?</i>

397
00:29:34,856 --> 00:29:37,268
<i>He can be so dense.</i>

398
00:29:38,277 --> 00:29:40,564
<i>You were going to give him</i>
<i>the scarf, weren't you?</i>

399
00:29:41,446 --> 00:29:42,436
<i>Uh-huh...</i>

400
00:29:42,823 --> 00:29:44,439
<i>You can do it, Hinata.</i>

401
00:29:45,284 --> 00:29:46,399
<i>Be confident.</i>

402
00:29:47,202 --> 00:29:48,192
<i>Thanks...</i>

403
00:29:48,996 --> 00:29:51,283
<i>Naruto, I...</i>

404
00:29:51,665 --> 00:29:53,281
<i>You really like ramen, don't you?</i>

405
00:29:53,375 --> 00:29:55,116
<i>Yup, I love it.</i>

406
00:29:55,377 --> 00:29:57,789
<i>Naruto, I...</i>

407
00:29:57,879 --> 00:29:59,290
<i>You really like...</i>

408
00:29:59,339 --> 00:30:03,128
<i>Yup, I love Hinata!</i>

409
00:30:03,468 --> 00:30:05,004
<i>He's so dense...</i>

410
00:30:05,095 --> 00:30:07,632
<i>Maybe he doesn't know what love is.</i>

411
00:30:07,931 --> 00:30:09,137
<i>What do you mean?</i>

412
00:30:09,599 --> 00:30:11,306
<i>You know, loving sweet desserts</i>
<i>like shiratama and anmitsu</i>

413
00:30:11,351 --> 00:30:13,809
<i>is totally different than loving someone.</i>

414
00:30:13,937 --> 00:30:15,894
<i>Huh? It's not the same?</i>

415
00:30:18,442 --> 00:30:19,477
<i>Oh!</i>

416
00:30:19,568 --> 00:30:22,230
<i>Hinata! Oh, you're such an idiot!</i>

417
00:30:22,279 --> 00:30:23,314
<i>Huh?</i>

418
00:30:23,363 --> 00:30:25,070
<i>Why'd you call me an idiot?</i>

419
00:30:25,115 --> 00:30:27,197
<i>Senpai... The gyoza are ready.</i>

420
00:30:27,451 --> 00:30:28,441
<i>Let's eat!</i>

421
00:30:31,872 --> 00:30:33,203
<i>- Hinata!</i>
<i>- Oh...</i>

422
00:30:33,332 --> 00:30:34,322
<i>Senpai...</i>

423
00:30:41,882 --> 00:30:42,872
<i>Hinata...?!</i>

424
00:30:54,895 --> 00:30:57,933
NARUTO UZUMAKI

425
00:31:00,108 --> 00:31:01,098
<i>Hinata...</i>

426
00:31:03,070 --> 00:31:04,981
<i>That's why I'm not afraid to die...</i>

427
00:31:05,655 --> 00:31:07,396
<i>if it means I can protect you!</i>

428
00:31:10,577 --> 00:31:11,567
<i>Because...</i>

429
00:31:12,162 --> 00:31:13,277
<i>I love you, Naruto!</i>

430
00:31:18,919 --> 00:31:19,909
<i>Hinata...</i>

431
00:31:23,340 --> 00:31:24,375
<i>Naruto!</i>

432
00:31:24,424 --> 00:31:25,414
<i>Wake up!</i>

433
00:31:25,675 --> 00:31:26,710
<i>This is a dream!</i>

434
00:31:29,388 --> 00:31:31,299
Oh...Sakura.

435
00:31:32,057 --> 00:31:33,297
You're finally awake!

436
00:31:33,517 --> 00:31:34,507
Huh?

437
00:31:35,435 --> 00:31:37,551
Is this a trap set by the enemy?

438
00:31:37,854 --> 00:31:40,642
Yeah. It traps intruders
in a genjutsu

439
00:31:40,690 --> 00:31:42,556
and shuts them away in
a world of memories.

440
00:31:42,859 --> 00:31:44,816
It's a prison of caged memories.

441
00:31:45,529 --> 00:31:48,237
Thank goodness Sakura who's
resistant to genjutsu was with us.

442
00:31:48,782 --> 00:31:49,817
Thanks, Sakura...

443
00:31:50,075 --> 00:31:51,406
I was having a fun dream
with my big brother in it.

444
00:31:51,493 --> 00:31:52,483
I appreciate you
breaking it apart for me.

445
00:31:53,370 --> 00:31:55,407
That doesn't sound like gratitude.

446
00:31:59,543 --> 00:32:00,578
Another spring...

447
00:32:01,169 --> 00:32:02,751
Your Byakugan doesn't
work here either?

448
00:32:03,672 --> 00:32:04,753
No, my field of sight is distorted.

449
00:32:04,923 --> 00:32:06,914
All right,
be ready to fight as we proceed!

450
00:32:07,175 --> 00:32:08,210
- Roger!
- Roger!

451
00:32:14,516 --> 00:32:15,506
What's the matter?

452
00:32:16,351 --> 00:32:19,764
About those genjutsu dreams
earlier...

453
00:32:20,230 --> 00:32:21,937
Huh? What is it?

454
00:32:23,483 --> 00:32:25,474
No... Never mind.

455
00:32:35,245 --> 00:32:36,280
Hinata...

456
00:32:37,914 --> 00:32:39,450
I said I'd come for you...

457
00:32:40,083 --> 00:32:41,790
To have you come to me...

458
00:32:42,627 --> 00:32:43,742
Where is Hanabi?!

459
00:32:44,421 --> 00:32:48,631
Don't worry.
She's fast asleep in my castle.

460
00:32:49,259 --> 00:32:50,624
Return Hanabi!

461
00:32:51,303 --> 00:32:53,294
That will all depend
on your answer...

462
00:32:54,639 --> 00:32:56,004
Byakugan Princess.

463
00:32:56,600 --> 00:32:58,466
Byakugan Princess?

464
00:32:59,686 --> 00:33:04,305
Hinata... Let us be married.

465
00:33:04,774 --> 00:33:06,765
Huh? Be married?

466
00:33:19,080 --> 00:33:21,663
It's like a bubble factory.

467
00:33:23,001 --> 00:33:24,036
I get it.

468
00:33:24,252 --> 00:33:25,242
Huh?

469
00:33:25,295 --> 00:33:28,629
This is where the gatekeeper
who made the bubbles lives.

470
00:33:28,840 --> 00:33:29,830
Gatekeeper?

471
00:33:30,967 --> 00:33:32,332
Naruto and Hinata are late...

472
00:33:33,470 --> 00:33:35,086
Should we go back to check on—?!

473
00:33:40,810 --> 00:33:41,800
A...A crab...?!

474
00:33:41,853 --> 00:33:43,014
That's the gatekeeper!

475
00:33:48,902 --> 00:33:49,892
Hinata!

476
00:33:49,986 --> 00:33:50,976
Naruto...!

477
00:33:51,988 --> 00:33:53,353
Don't get near Hinata!

478
00:33:54,032 --> 00:33:57,366
You again. You're in the way... Move.

479
00:33:57,577 --> 00:33:58,692
Where is Hanabi?!

480
00:34:01,331 --> 00:34:02,321
Scatter!

481
00:34:05,669 --> 00:34:06,909
Don't destroy the bubbles

482
00:34:07,003 --> 00:34:08,869
or we'll get caught
in a genjutsu again!

483
00:34:11,841 --> 00:34:12,922
Chōjū Giga!

484
00:34:18,807 --> 00:34:20,138
Fujin! Raijin!

485
00:34:48,545 --> 00:34:49,535
Damn it!

486
00:34:51,172 --> 00:34:52,162
Kage Nui! (Shadow Stitching)

487
00:34:57,178 --> 00:34:58,168
Sakura!

488
00:34:59,889 --> 00:35:01,596
Cha!

489
00:35:05,103 --> 00:35:06,093
Damn it!

490
00:35:34,090 --> 00:35:36,548
You're a puppet?!

491
00:35:38,720 --> 00:35:41,678
This is not my body.

492
00:35:43,600 --> 00:35:44,590
Hinata...

493
00:35:45,352 --> 00:35:48,060
Next time, the real me
will come for you.

494
00:35:49,105 --> 00:35:51,813
Give me an answer then.

495
00:35:52,025 --> 00:35:53,015
Shut up!

496
00:35:59,449 --> 00:36:04,819
Your fists...will never reach me...
...ever.

497
00:36:12,128 --> 00:36:14,836
Did your punch do this, Sakura?

498
00:36:15,090 --> 00:36:16,080
Oh yeah.

499
00:36:16,925 --> 00:36:19,257
Naruto, if you leave Hinata behind
and expose her to danger again,

500
00:36:19,302 --> 00:36:21,009
you'll get a taste of my fists too...

501
00:36:21,179 --> 00:36:22,590
I know.

502
00:36:23,139 --> 00:36:25,221
Hinata, I'll never let you...

503
00:36:27,894 --> 00:36:29,931
I'll never let you
out of my sight again.

504
00:36:30,397 --> 00:36:31,387
What?

505
00:36:31,481 --> 00:36:32,812
You're already looking away.

506
00:36:32,857 --> 00:36:35,474
Huh? I'm not looking away.

507
00:36:43,827 --> 00:36:45,818
What is this place?

508
00:37:00,885 --> 00:37:02,375
Is that island floating?

509
00:37:02,762 --> 00:37:03,752
No...

510
00:37:04,013 --> 00:37:06,050
The surface of the ocean is warped.

511
00:37:07,100 --> 00:37:08,966
There's sunlight underground too.

512
00:37:09,519 --> 00:37:11,101
Isn't that a fake?

513
00:37:11,688 --> 00:37:12,974
A man-made sun?

514
00:37:13,148 --> 00:37:14,138
Yeah.

515
00:37:20,613 --> 00:37:22,445
Hinata, any sign of the enemy?

516
00:37:23,158 --> 00:37:24,148
No, we're good.

517
00:37:24,784 --> 00:37:26,775
The enemy is aware of us...

518
00:37:27,036 --> 00:37:28,447
Why aren't they attacking?

519
00:37:28,747 --> 00:37:30,784
Yeah, that bothers me.

520
00:37:31,040 --> 00:37:32,622
It's too quiet.

521
00:37:39,883 --> 00:37:40,918
Leave them.

522
00:37:42,552 --> 00:37:44,759
Don't do anything
until I go to get her.

523
00:37:46,514 --> 00:37:47,504
Oh...

524
00:37:48,016 --> 00:37:49,677
The eyes are twitching again.

525
00:37:50,602 --> 00:37:53,811
Amazing...
This Byakugan is very pure.

526
00:38:01,237 --> 00:38:03,478
Huh? Hinata?

527
00:38:14,417 --> 00:38:15,498
<i>That scarf...</i>

528
00:38:15,877 --> 00:38:17,288
<i>Is it really for me...?</i>

529
00:38:20,131 --> 00:38:22,623
I see a town about 20 kilos ahead.

530
00:38:22,801 --> 00:38:23,962
All right, let's go.

531
00:38:38,399 --> 00:38:39,810
There's no one here.

532
00:38:40,109 --> 00:38:42,441
This town was built
a few centuries ago...

533
00:38:42,862 --> 00:38:44,352
Let's split up and search.

534
00:38:49,953 --> 00:38:51,990
So it's a shinobi village.

535
00:38:53,957 --> 00:38:54,947
A fire?

536
00:38:56,125 --> 00:38:57,786
What is this?

537
00:39:02,298 --> 00:39:04,255
Was there a war long ago?

538
00:39:08,137 --> 00:39:09,218
What's wrong, Hinata?!

539
00:39:11,224 --> 00:39:12,339
It's a spider web.

540
00:39:13,977 --> 00:39:15,718
You can see far with your Byakugan,

541
00:39:16,145 --> 00:39:18,056
but you walk straight into
a spider web...

542
00:39:18,147 --> 00:39:19,353
You're so silly!

543
00:39:27,657 --> 00:39:28,692
Naruto...

544
00:39:29,242 --> 00:39:30,323
What is it?

545
00:39:30,660 --> 00:39:33,027
Umm... What happened to your scarf?

546
00:39:34,163 --> 00:39:35,198
Oh...

547
00:39:35,540 --> 00:39:38,248
It's warm underground,
so I took it off.

548
00:39:38,585 --> 00:39:40,792
I...I see...

549
00:39:42,046 --> 00:39:44,538
I feel a bit cold...

550
00:39:44,841 --> 00:39:48,630
I'll bet you are,
dressed like that.

551
00:39:48,928 --> 00:39:50,965
It's just that,
this is my mission gear.

552
00:39:51,347 --> 00:39:52,678
If you can take it...

553
00:39:53,266 --> 00:39:55,052
I can handle a little cold
like this.

554
00:39:58,313 --> 00:39:59,303
Are you okay?

555
00:40:00,690 --> 00:40:02,101
I'm totally fine!

556
00:40:04,527 --> 00:40:05,562
What?

557
00:40:05,653 --> 00:40:06,814
It's nothing.

558
00:40:07,196 --> 00:40:08,231
What is it?

559
00:40:08,823 --> 00:40:10,029
I said it's nothing.

560
00:40:10,283 --> 00:40:11,569
Tell me!

561
00:40:19,751 --> 00:40:20,741
That was so good.

562
00:40:23,463 --> 00:40:24,544
Are you going somewhere?

563
00:40:24,589 --> 00:40:25,795
I'm gonna take a leak.

564
00:40:32,889 --> 00:40:33,924
Naruto!

565
00:40:36,643 --> 00:40:37,929
A spider web...

566
00:40:39,103 --> 00:40:40,093
You okay?

567
00:40:40,229 --> 00:40:41,264
Yeah...

568
00:40:41,814 --> 00:40:42,895
<i>Ow...</i>

569
00:40:42,941 --> 00:40:44,022
What's wrong?

570
00:40:44,233 --> 00:40:46,395
I think I hurt my back.

571
00:40:48,154 --> 00:40:49,144
Here you go.

572
00:40:49,530 --> 00:40:50,520
Thanks.

573
00:40:51,199 --> 00:40:52,189
Oh yeah...

574
00:40:52,408 --> 00:40:54,866
You gave me some ointment back
during the Chunin Exams.

575
00:40:56,955 --> 00:40:58,571
You remembered all this time?

576
00:40:59,082 --> 00:41:02,450
Actually... I...I just remembered...

577
00:41:24,315 --> 00:41:25,305
Thanks...

578
00:41:35,451 --> 00:41:37,988
We have to hurry and
rescue Hanabi...

579
00:41:40,289 --> 00:41:42,656
Naruto, I'd like to talk to you
about something...

580
00:41:43,042 --> 00:41:44,032
What is it?

581
00:41:44,752 --> 00:41:48,336
About what you said when
that puppet Toneri appeared...

582
00:41:48,965 --> 00:41:50,000
Toneri?

583
00:41:51,050 --> 00:41:52,040
Here they are!

584
00:41:52,969 --> 00:41:55,506
Hinata, we need you to
check something.

585
00:41:57,140 --> 00:41:58,551
What's it say?

586
00:41:59,142 --> 00:42:01,008
It's some ancient writing...

587
00:42:01,644 --> 00:42:03,009
<i>Ancient oath</i>

588
00:42:03,062 --> 00:42:04,177
<i>Crossing the path of humanity</i>

589
00:42:04,272 --> 00:42:05,433
<i>Like all else</i>

590
00:42:06,566 --> 00:42:08,398
<i>The fist of the Tensei Eye</i>
<i>the reborn moon,</i>

591
00:42:08,484 --> 00:42:10,816
<i>will destroy man...</i>

592
00:42:11,320 --> 00:42:12,355
What does that mean?

593
00:42:12,488 --> 00:42:15,697
Maybe the "Tensei Eye"...
is making the moon move.

594
00:42:17,160 --> 00:42:18,821
So Kakashi Sensei was right...

595
00:42:18,870 --> 00:42:20,577
Hanabi's abduction and the moon
are somehow connected...

596
00:42:20,705 --> 00:42:25,290
Well, his hunches are always
on target...unfortunately.

597
00:42:26,753 --> 00:42:28,585
Byakugan Princess...

598
00:42:30,882 --> 00:42:31,872
What's that?!

599
00:42:46,022 --> 00:42:49,060
Is this...a burial site?

600
00:42:50,777 --> 00:42:51,812
What's this?

601
00:42:52,403 --> 00:42:53,393
Someone's here!

602
00:42:57,033 --> 00:43:00,992
The Byakugan...
I sense the Byakugan!

603
00:43:02,205 --> 00:43:05,118
Oh, I'm certain of it!

604
00:43:06,167 --> 00:43:08,204
Oh, Byakugan Princess!

605
00:43:08,795 --> 00:43:10,081
Stay away from Hinata!

606
00:43:36,864 --> 00:43:37,854
Hinata!

607
00:43:38,866 --> 00:43:40,152
What did you do to Hinata?!

608
00:43:42,411 --> 00:43:46,120
The Tenseigan...has been revived...

609
00:43:49,544 --> 00:43:50,909
It must be stopped...

610
00:43:51,838 --> 00:43:53,374
Otsutsuki...

611
00:43:57,260 --> 00:43:58,842
Hinata, are you all right?

612
00:43:59,554 --> 00:44:00,544
Uh-huh...

613
00:44:00,596 --> 00:44:03,213
That man said something
like Otsutsuki.

614
00:44:03,641 --> 00:44:06,053
That's the original surname
of the Sage of Six Paths.

615
00:44:07,019 --> 00:44:08,350
Hagoromo Otsutsuki.

616
00:44:08,896 --> 00:44:10,261
That was the name
of the Sage of Six Paths

617
00:44:10,314 --> 00:44:11,304
before he entered the priesthood.

618
00:44:11,941 --> 00:44:14,478
And he called Hinata
the Byakugan Princess...

619
00:44:15,403 --> 00:44:18,816
Seems Toneri's abduction
of Hanabi is connected.

620
00:44:28,291 --> 00:44:29,281
<i>Knitting...</i>

621
00:44:29,959 --> 00:44:32,166
<i>Is she going to</i>
<i>keep knitting forever?</i>

622
00:44:33,254 --> 00:44:35,336
<i>I guess it takes a lot of time.</i>

623
00:44:36,549 --> 00:44:39,837
Hinata, what was it that
you wanted to talk about earlier?

624
00:44:42,972 --> 00:44:45,259
You mentioned something about
what Toneri's puppet said?

625
00:44:46,642 --> 00:44:49,430
Oh, that... It was nothing.

626
00:44:49,979 --> 00:44:52,971
Huh? What do you mean nothing?

627
00:44:55,151 --> 00:44:58,564
I'm sorry. I want to be alone.

628
00:45:03,910 --> 00:45:04,945
I see...

629
00:45:27,016 --> 00:45:28,347
Let's check out that village.

630
00:45:49,705 --> 00:45:52,538
Seems like Hanabi's
not here anymore.

631
00:46:18,276 --> 00:46:20,608
We should head back
and rejoin the others.

632
00:46:21,654 --> 00:46:22,644
Uh-huh.

633
00:47:04,280 --> 00:47:05,315
Hinata...

634
00:47:06,198 --> 00:47:08,155
My younger sister is
in so much danger...

635
00:47:08,326 --> 00:47:09,532
And here I am knitting.

636
00:47:10,286 --> 00:47:11,492
I'm a terrible big sister,
aren't I?

637
00:47:12,455 --> 00:47:13,820
That's not true.

638
00:47:13,998 --> 00:47:17,992
You've come all this way
just to save your sister.

639
00:47:19,128 --> 00:47:22,211
If only I'd stayed home then...

640
00:47:22,298 --> 00:47:25,461
Don't worry.
I swear I'll rescue Hanabi.

641
00:47:27,345 --> 00:47:28,380
Thank you.

642
00:47:28,763 --> 00:47:31,425
You're so kind, Naruto.

643
00:47:34,268 --> 00:47:38,683
Hey, I'm not just being kind
because I love you or anything...

644
00:47:38,814 --> 00:47:40,805
I'm just worried about Hanabi...

645
00:47:41,484 --> 00:47:43,350
- What did you just say?
- Huh?

646
00:47:43,778 --> 00:47:44,893
What did you say?

647
00:47:46,822 --> 00:47:48,688
I'm worried about Hanabi.

648
00:47:50,743 --> 00:47:52,154
No, before that.

649
00:47:53,287 --> 00:47:54,402
Before that...

650
00:48:00,961 --> 00:48:01,951
Hinata...

651
00:48:05,091 --> 00:48:08,629
I...love you.

652
00:48:24,610 --> 00:48:25,645
Hinata...

653
00:48:45,047 --> 00:48:47,664
Toneri! Are you another puppet?!

654
00:48:48,717 --> 00:48:49,798
Where is Hanabi?!

655
00:48:50,010 --> 00:48:51,000
Silence.

656
00:48:51,345 --> 00:48:53,302
I came to hear Hinata's answer.

657
00:48:53,889 --> 00:48:57,302
Answer? Hinata has nothing
to say to you!

658
00:48:57,560 --> 00:48:58,891
So where's Hanabi...?

659
00:49:01,397 --> 00:49:02,432
Hinata...

660
00:49:05,943 --> 00:49:06,933
Hey...

661
00:49:07,403 --> 00:49:09,644
Hinata! What's going on?!

662
00:49:17,204 --> 00:49:20,037
Goodbye...Naruto.

663
00:49:43,063 --> 00:49:44,269
Hinata!

664
00:50:07,463 --> 00:50:08,999
Give Hinata back!

665
00:50:09,590 --> 00:50:10,705
Give her back?

666
00:50:11,967 --> 00:50:14,550
Hinata came to me willingly.

667
00:50:16,639 --> 00:50:18,175
This has been destined
since ancient times.

668
00:50:18,974 --> 00:50:20,715
Hinata and I shall be wed.

669
00:50:21,143 --> 00:50:22,178
<i>Wed?</i>

670
00:50:23,395 --> 00:50:24,385
Hinata!

671
00:50:24,480 --> 00:50:25,470
That's a lie, right?!

672
00:50:46,627 --> 00:50:47,742
<i>My chakra is...</i>

673
00:51:13,529 --> 00:51:14,564
What are you doing?

674
00:51:14,947 --> 00:51:16,688
I don't want to
get into a petty fight

675
00:51:16,740 --> 00:51:18,697
and risk getting you hurt.

676
00:51:52,401 --> 00:51:53,482
Hinata...

677
00:52:14,048 --> 00:52:15,254
Hurry up and go!

678
00:52:15,549 --> 00:52:16,539
I can't go any further!

679
00:52:16,592 --> 00:52:18,253
Hey! Stay in line!

680
00:52:18,302 --> 00:52:19,337
Don't panic!

681
00:52:19,428 --> 00:52:21,385
The air raid shelter was constructed...

682
00:52:21,430 --> 00:52:23,888
to accommodate every citizen
in the Land of Fire!

683
00:52:27,227 --> 00:52:29,093
Keep calm!
Please keep calm!

684
00:52:33,275 --> 00:52:35,016
Suiton! Suiryūdan no Jutsu!
(Water Style! Water Dragon Jutsu)

685
00:52:36,070 --> 00:52:37,856
Yōton! Yōkai no Jutsu!
(Lava Style! Lava Monster Jutsu)

686
00:52:41,408 --> 00:52:43,991
Jinton! Genkai Hakuri no Jutsu!
(Particle Style! Atomic Dismantling Jutsu)

687
00:52:50,834 --> 00:52:52,074
Damn it! My back!

688
00:53:00,469 --> 00:53:02,460
So this was the moon.

689
00:53:02,513 --> 00:53:03,469
Yeah...

690
00:53:03,722 --> 00:53:05,713
The space where we found
the crab's bubbles

691
00:53:05,808 --> 00:53:08,015
is probably the passageway
that connects the Earth to the moon.

692
00:53:12,815 --> 00:53:13,896
How is Naruto doing?

693
00:53:14,483 --> 00:53:15,268
Terrible.

694
00:53:15,526 --> 00:53:17,517
Most of his chakra's been sucked out.

695
00:53:21,865 --> 00:53:23,026
Hinata...

696
00:53:24,618 --> 00:53:28,532
So you finally get it...
you blockhead.

697
00:53:34,586 --> 00:53:36,042
So beautiful...

698
00:53:37,172 --> 00:53:41,040
Hinata... I want to know more about you.

699
00:53:48,434 --> 00:53:50,050
Why is he...?

700
00:53:58,193 --> 00:53:59,399
Where am I?

701
00:54:11,039 --> 00:54:12,450
This is... Toneri's castle...

702
00:54:25,471 --> 00:54:26,836
Hanabi!

703
00:54:30,934 --> 00:54:33,266
Hanabi's eyes have been taken!

704
00:54:35,939 --> 00:54:37,725
<i>Hinata...</i>

705
00:54:38,692 --> 00:54:41,309
Hinata... Let us be married.

706
00:54:42,654 --> 00:54:43,769
Huh? Married?

707
00:54:44,072 --> 00:54:46,439
What are you saying?!
Let Hanabi...

708
00:54:48,994 --> 00:54:51,326
Your sister is in my castle.

709
00:54:51,497 --> 00:54:52,407
Hanabi!

710
00:54:55,167 --> 00:54:58,000
I've taken her Byakugan.

711
00:54:59,379 --> 00:55:00,665
You're terrible.

712
00:55:01,590 --> 00:55:02,625
I'm sorry.

713
00:55:02,925 --> 00:55:04,666
It's due to Hamura's Celestial Decree.

714
00:55:04,802 --> 00:55:05,963
Hamura...?

715
00:55:06,011 --> 00:55:09,299
Hamura Otsutsuki. The founder of
the Shinobi of the Moon.

716
00:55:09,723 --> 00:55:12,090
Perhaps, it's easier to understand
if I say he's the younger brother

717
00:55:12,142 --> 00:55:15,134
of the Sage of Six Paths,
founder of the Shinobi of Earth.

718
00:55:15,771 --> 00:55:19,560
Your Hyuga Clan inherited
Hamura's blood.

719
00:55:21,652 --> 00:55:25,236
The story goes back many eons...
Several millennia, in fact.

720
00:55:26,406 --> 00:55:28,818
The Sage of the Six Paths,
the elder one, had misgivings.

721
00:55:29,993 --> 00:55:32,530
He feared that the Ten Tails

722
00:55:32,621 --> 00:55:35,079
with its massive chakra
and immeasurable power

723
00:55:35,123 --> 00:55:37,956
would bring calamity to the world.

724
00:55:39,211 --> 00:55:42,875
So the Sage of Six Paths extracted
the Ten Tails' chakra

725
00:55:42,965 --> 00:55:46,799
and divided it among nine
Tailed Beasts in order to weaken its power.

726
00:55:47,177 --> 00:55:49,509
The husk of the Ten Tails
whose chakra was extracted,

727
00:55:49,596 --> 00:55:52,884
namely the Gedo Statue, was hidden
away and sealed on the moon...

728
00:55:54,142 --> 00:55:56,679
so that the Ten Tails would
never be revived.

729
00:55:58,105 --> 00:56:00,187
Hamura decided to live
on the moon

730
00:56:00,274 --> 00:56:02,481
in order to guard the Gedo Statue.

731
00:56:03,902 --> 00:56:07,020
The Sage of Six Paths became
the founder of the Shinobi on Earth.

732
00:56:08,657 --> 00:56:11,365
But Hamura was skeptical
of the world

733
00:56:11,451 --> 00:56:13,067
his elder brother was creating.

734
00:56:13,704 --> 00:56:18,870
So if the world created by his brother
went astray from the shinobi way...

735
00:56:19,209 --> 00:56:22,702
he entrusted his descendants
with its destruction.

736
00:56:24,381 --> 00:56:26,748
Through the millennia
that have passed...

737
00:56:26,842 --> 00:56:29,584
fighting between shinobi
has not ceased.

738
00:56:30,137 --> 00:56:32,504
They continue to use chakra
as a weapon.

739
00:56:33,015 --> 00:56:36,007
Ultimately, the Gedo Statue was stolen,

740
00:56:36,059 --> 00:56:37,925
and even the Ten Tails
was revived.

741
00:56:39,354 --> 00:56:41,937
Our clan has reached
the conclusion

742
00:56:42,024 --> 00:56:45,562
that the Shinobi of Earth will destroy
the world's peace and order.

743
00:56:47,362 --> 00:56:50,024
The world that the Sage of
Six Paths created is a failure...

744
00:56:51,366 --> 00:56:54,484
So in accordance with
the Celestial Decree of Hamura,

745
00:56:54,536 --> 00:56:56,948
I will destroy the world
of the Sage of Six Paths.

746
00:56:58,415 --> 00:57:02,955
When this pure Byakugan
synergizes with my chakra,

747
00:57:03,337 --> 00:57:05,078
it will transform into the Tenseigan.

748
00:57:06,381 --> 00:57:09,248
With its Visual Prowess,
I will pick up the ashes of Earth

749
00:57:09,968 --> 00:57:11,800
and create a brand new world...

750
00:57:11,887 --> 00:57:13,377
I don't believe your story.

751
00:57:13,722 --> 00:57:15,633
And I'm going to rescue Hanabi!

752
00:57:16,475 --> 00:57:19,308
Even when you don't know
where this castle is located?

753
00:57:21,855 --> 00:57:24,017
I'll return for your answer.

754
00:57:26,318 --> 00:57:27,433
Hinata!

755
00:57:34,826 --> 00:57:35,782
Good morning.

756
00:57:38,830 --> 00:57:42,619
I'm happy that you understand
how I feel, Hinata.

757
00:57:47,214 --> 00:57:50,332
Lady Hinata, welcome to the castle.

758
00:57:50,509 --> 00:57:51,670
- Welcome.
- Welcome.

759
00:57:52,052 --> 00:57:53,963
There are only puppets in this castle.

760
00:57:54,471 --> 00:57:57,554
They're marionettes left here
by our ancestors.

761
00:57:58,809 --> 00:58:01,176
Since my father died
when I was young,

762
00:58:01,436 --> 00:58:04,645
I've lived in the castle all by myself.

763
00:58:08,026 --> 00:58:10,063
We will hold
the marriage ceremony here.

764
00:58:10,946 --> 00:58:13,529
Then we will enter
the Room of Rebirth...

765
00:58:13,615 --> 00:58:15,447
and fall into a deep slumber

766
00:58:15,492 --> 00:58:18,154
until the Earth's environment
stabilizes after its destruction.

767
00:58:18,328 --> 00:58:19,363
That's impossible!

768
00:58:19,705 --> 00:58:21,195
The moon will also be destroyed.

769
00:58:21,456 --> 00:58:25,324
Don't worry. This castle is protected
by a strong chakra.

770
00:58:25,544 --> 00:58:27,160
Strong chakra?

771
00:58:27,295 --> 00:58:29,536
Yes... Strong enough to
move the moon.

772
00:58:29,840 --> 00:58:31,001
What do you mean?

773
00:58:31,466 --> 00:58:33,127
It's the power of Otsutsuki's treasure,

774
00:58:33,176 --> 00:58:36,669
honed from the sufferings
of my clan.

775
00:58:37,055 --> 00:58:39,922
Where would such a thing be?

776
00:58:42,853 --> 00:58:44,184
That is something...

777
00:58:47,691 --> 00:58:48,977
I cannot tell you.

778
00:58:52,612 --> 00:58:56,401
May I return to my room?
It's cold outside...

779
00:58:57,784 --> 00:59:00,025
That's because
it's dusk here all year.

780
00:59:02,080 --> 00:59:03,411
Oh, that's right...

781
00:59:04,166 --> 00:59:05,702
Will you knit me a scarf?

782
00:59:05,792 --> 00:59:06,702
Huh?

783
00:59:08,754 --> 00:59:10,290
A scarf just for me...

784
00:59:14,134 --> 00:59:15,249
Do you refuse?

785
00:59:17,012 --> 00:59:17,968
I understand.

786
00:59:18,638 --> 00:59:20,754
Really? Thank you.

787
00:59:21,850 --> 00:59:23,716
You've made me happy, Hinata.

788
00:59:29,107 --> 00:59:30,268
What's wrong?

789
00:59:30,859 --> 00:59:32,065
Don't worry.

790
00:59:33,028 --> 00:59:36,020
It's proof that the Byakugan is maturing
into the Tenseigan.

791
00:59:36,948 --> 00:59:38,734
It will subside with a little rest.

792
00:59:45,999 --> 00:59:47,455
It doesn't seem to be here.

793
00:59:49,294 --> 00:59:50,910
<i>Byakugan Princess...</i>

794
01:00:20,742 --> 01:00:22,449
Tenseigan...activate!

795
01:01:00,866 --> 01:01:03,403
We are descendants of Hamura...

796
01:01:03,618 --> 01:01:06,701
We belong to the main family
of the Otsutsuki Clan.

797
01:01:06,955 --> 01:01:09,822
We were annihilated by
the branch family,

798
01:01:09,875 --> 01:01:13,209
who has twisted the interpretation
of Hamura's Celestial Decree.

799
01:01:14,129 --> 01:01:17,872
Toneri, a descendant of the branch family,
is attempting to make the moon

800
01:01:17,966 --> 01:01:21,834
fall into the Earth by using
the power of the Tenseigan.

801
01:01:22,888 --> 01:01:30,181
Only you can destroy
the Tenseigan, Byakugan Princess...

802
01:01:44,993 --> 01:01:49,362
You are...Hamura Otsutsuki!

803
01:01:53,251 --> 01:01:55,037
Byakugan Princess...

804
01:01:56,004 --> 01:02:00,589
Do not let the world my elder brother
created come to an end!

805
01:02:08,934 --> 01:02:11,676
Hanabi...you poor thing...

806
01:02:14,189 --> 01:02:18,183
I'll definitely find and destroy...
the Tenseigan!

807
01:02:21,196 --> 01:02:22,812
Imagine that...

808
01:02:22,864 --> 01:02:24,400
Toneri has been hiding
in the artificial sun.

809
01:02:24,658 --> 01:02:27,741
Why wasn't Hinata's Byakugan
able to discover it?

810
01:02:28,328 --> 01:02:32,071
Maybe he has a jutsu on the artificial moon
that deflects the Byakugan too?

811
01:02:33,083 --> 01:02:34,198
Where's the entrance?

812
01:02:34,918 --> 01:02:36,909
Why don't we ask them?

813
01:02:42,133 --> 01:02:42,964
What are you doing?

814
01:02:43,051 --> 01:02:44,416
You've alerted the enemy!

815
01:02:44,803 --> 01:02:45,884
Follow me!

816
01:02:46,721 --> 01:02:47,882
What are you doing?

817
01:02:47,931 --> 01:02:49,262
I'll explain later.

818
01:03:02,070 --> 01:03:03,560
So is that how it is...

819
01:03:04,447 --> 01:03:05,937
Sai, retreat!

820
01:03:18,461 --> 01:03:19,747
Chōjū Giga!

821
01:03:28,805 --> 01:03:32,218
I never imagined that his turn to appear
would come after the war,

822
01:03:32,267 --> 01:03:34,178
when the world was peaceful.

823
01:03:35,687 --> 01:03:37,678
Beneath is the Chakra Diffusion Cannon.

824
01:03:38,773 --> 01:03:42,311
We'll blast all the meteorites
above the equator.

825
01:03:42,944 --> 01:03:45,151
On top is the Chakra
Transportation Cannon.

826
01:03:45,280 --> 01:03:48,523
It can transport any target
into another dimension.

827
01:03:48,950 --> 01:03:50,782
With these, we'll destroy the moon!

828
01:03:51,244 --> 01:03:54,487
Everyone, get the cannons
ready immediately!

829
01:04:00,962 --> 01:04:03,499
Meals are nice when
you have someone to talk to.

830
01:04:05,842 --> 01:04:08,504
Now tell me all about yourself.

831
01:04:11,097 --> 01:04:14,215
It's not too late to negotiate
with the Shinobi of Earth.

832
01:04:14,601 --> 01:04:15,511
What?

833
01:04:15,560 --> 01:04:16,675
You're right.

834
01:04:16,728 --> 01:04:18,810
The Shinobi of Earth
have used chakra

835
01:04:18,855 --> 01:04:20,721
and continued fighting.

836
01:04:20,982 --> 01:04:22,768
But it's different now.

837
01:04:23,318 --> 01:04:25,559
In order to protect
this hard-fought peace...

838
01:04:25,653 --> 01:04:27,064
shinobi have joined together.

839
01:04:27,155 --> 01:04:28,395
So...

840
01:04:28,490 --> 01:04:30,572
They will start another war.

841
01:04:31,117 --> 01:04:34,075
The Sage of Six Paths' world
must be destroyed.

842
01:04:34,245 --> 01:04:35,201
But...

843
01:04:36,998 --> 01:04:38,864
Never bring up that subject again.

844
01:04:39,501 --> 01:04:40,866
Now be quiet and eat.

845
01:04:50,512 --> 01:04:52,048
That island...

846
01:04:52,347 --> 01:04:53,803
So it's appeared already...

847
01:04:54,599 --> 01:04:56,465
That is the temple of the Hamura.

848
01:04:57,185 --> 01:05:01,520
Once a year, during the Rebirth Festival,
it comes near the castle.

849
01:05:07,445 --> 01:05:08,810
<i>I'm sure of it...</i>

850
01:05:10,573 --> 01:05:13,440
<i>The Tenseigan is hidden</i>
<i>on that island.</i>

851
01:05:18,248 --> 01:05:21,411
Good-bye, Naruto...

852
01:05:23,044 --> 01:05:24,079
<i>Hinata...</i>

853
01:05:26,131 --> 01:05:27,087
Hinata!

854
01:05:27,632 --> 01:05:28,997
You're finally awake.

855
01:05:29,717 --> 01:05:30,798
Finally?

856
01:05:31,636 --> 01:05:33,126
It's been three days.

857
01:05:33,513 --> 01:05:34,298
Huh?

858
01:05:34,806 --> 01:05:36,888
Did something happen
between you and Hinata?

859
01:05:38,059 --> 01:05:39,766
No, not really.

860
01:05:40,437 --> 01:05:43,270
You kept groaning her name...
Hinata, Hinata...

861
01:05:44,065 --> 01:05:46,147
As well as some
other embarrassing things.

862
01:05:47,235 --> 01:05:50,102
But I got to listen in
on your mushy side.

863
01:05:50,196 --> 01:05:51,937
It was great research material for me.

864
01:05:52,031 --> 01:05:52,896
Come on...

865
01:05:56,578 --> 01:05:57,784
Naruto...

866
01:05:57,829 --> 01:05:59,945
Let's go rescue Hinata and Hanabi.

867
01:06:02,750 --> 01:06:05,162
Is it hard to see the woman
who dumped you?

868
01:06:05,462 --> 01:06:09,547
So Naruto's strong as a shinobi
but he can't handle a broken heart?

869
01:06:10,091 --> 01:06:11,172
Now I know your weakness!

870
01:06:11,259 --> 01:06:12,294
Hey!

871
01:06:17,015 --> 01:06:21,475
Hamura must be happy that
you personally want to pay homage.

872
01:06:28,860 --> 01:06:31,397
<i>The Tenseigan...is inside here.</i>

873
01:06:46,294 --> 01:06:47,750
This is...

874
01:06:48,046 --> 01:06:49,332
The Tenseigan.

875
01:06:50,215 --> 01:06:53,082
Then this is Otsutsuki's Treasure
that is moving the moon?

876
01:06:54,802 --> 01:06:58,011
Lady Hinata, only those
in exalted positions

877
01:06:58,056 --> 01:07:01,014
are allowed to see
the real Tenseigan.

878
01:07:01,309 --> 01:07:05,519
This is a temple where others
of lower rank come to pray.

879
01:07:06,898 --> 01:07:07,888
I see...

880
01:07:11,778 --> 01:07:16,147
I shall show you the real Tenseigan
after we are married.

881
01:07:29,837 --> 01:07:31,748
<i>My field of vision is distorted</i>
<i>only at that spot.</i>

882
01:07:33,258 --> 01:07:35,249
<i>I see... I get it!</i>

883
01:07:40,348 --> 01:07:42,214
How long are you going
to be like that?

884
01:07:48,147 --> 01:07:50,013
You gave up on a woman.

885
01:07:50,066 --> 01:07:51,727
So why not give up on
becoming a Hokage too?

886
01:07:53,736 --> 01:07:55,272
Yeah! Give it up!

887
01:07:55,363 --> 01:07:57,445
Give up on the woman
as well as becoming Hokage!

888
01:07:57,532 --> 01:07:59,239
What?! Shikamaru!

889
01:07:59,534 --> 01:08:01,070
Are you picking a fight?!

890
01:08:01,119 --> 01:08:03,907
I don't care what happens
between you and Hinata.

891
01:08:03,997 --> 01:08:05,453
But you're a shinobi!

892
01:08:07,584 --> 01:08:08,665
Come with me.

893
01:08:22,515 --> 01:08:24,256
I'm going to my room to rest.

894
01:08:24,892 --> 01:08:28,010
I'm looking forward
to the finished scarf.

895
01:08:44,662 --> 01:08:46,824
I feel it... I can feel it!

896
01:08:47,832 --> 01:08:49,618
The beating in my eyes.

897
01:08:51,502 --> 01:08:53,243
It will be born very soon...

898
01:08:54,047 --> 01:08:56,038
The complete Tenseigan!

899
01:09:04,849 --> 01:09:05,964
Sakura...

900
01:09:06,434 --> 01:09:08,971
It's the result of infusing nearly
every ounce of her chakra into you...

901
01:09:09,062 --> 01:09:11,178
so that she could
prevent you from dying.

902
01:09:12,815 --> 01:09:13,805
Sakura!

903
01:09:17,111 --> 01:09:18,192
Naruto...

904
01:09:18,279 --> 01:09:20,611
Sakura... I'm so sorry.

905
01:09:20,865 --> 01:09:24,153
Are you going to depend on Sakura
to heal not only his body,

906
01:09:24,243 --> 01:09:25,904
but his heart as well?

907
01:09:26,120 --> 01:09:27,986
Can you do it?

908
01:09:29,666 --> 01:09:30,656
You have a point.

909
01:09:34,587 --> 01:09:35,577
I see...

910
01:09:36,214 --> 01:09:39,798
I never thought you'd confess
your love first.

911
01:09:40,677 --> 01:09:45,387
Remember long ago,
when you said you loved me?

912
01:09:47,684 --> 01:09:51,928
But...wasn't that because
I loved Sasuke?

913
01:09:53,106 --> 01:09:54,892
You didn't want to lose to him.

914
01:09:57,985 --> 01:09:59,646
It's real this time, isn't it?

915
01:10:00,488 --> 01:10:02,195
Hinata is a great person.

916
01:10:03,032 --> 01:10:04,864
She's almost too good for you.

917
01:10:05,993 --> 01:10:08,109
But it's over...

918
01:10:08,621 --> 01:10:11,739
Hinata went to Toneri.

919
01:10:11,833 --> 01:10:13,073
You are so stupid.

920
01:10:13,501 --> 01:10:16,163
It's obvious she had a reason
that she couldn't reveal.

921
01:10:18,131 --> 01:10:20,919
When a girl truly falls in love,

922
01:10:21,092 --> 01:10:23,709
her feelings don't change
that easily.

923
01:10:24,429 --> 01:10:25,590
They can't change.

924
01:10:26,556 --> 01:10:29,674
I understand how she feels
very well.

925
01:11:02,049 --> 01:11:03,335
This is...

926
01:11:07,388 --> 01:11:08,594
the Tenseigan.

927
01:11:16,481 --> 01:11:18,392
<i>I'll stop the moon!</i>

928
01:11:43,424 --> 01:11:44,710
What's going on?

929
01:11:45,009 --> 01:11:46,545
You're wrong!

930
01:11:47,637 --> 01:11:48,593
What?

931
01:11:48,930 --> 01:11:52,423
Hamura's soul entrusted me
with the true Celestial Decree.

932
01:11:52,809 --> 01:11:55,972
You have distorted
Hamura's teachings!

933
01:11:56,354 --> 01:11:59,472
Hamura never wished
for the destruction of Earth...

934
01:11:59,565 --> 01:12:01,806
the Sage of Six Path's world!

935
01:12:03,903 --> 01:12:06,736
You've betrayed me...

936
01:12:08,741 --> 01:12:10,231
Please hear me out!
Hamura is—!

937
01:12:10,284 --> 01:12:11,649
Silence! They're lies!

938
01:12:11,953 --> 01:12:13,739
I don't believe it!

939
01:12:14,622 --> 01:12:16,704
There is only one Celestial Decree
that Hamura made!

940
01:12:16,791 --> 01:12:19,328
That is to end the world
of the Sage of Six Paths!

941
01:12:19,418 --> 01:12:20,499
Damn it!

942
01:12:20,711 --> 01:12:22,418
So you were knitting this...

943
01:12:22,463 --> 01:12:23,999
for him and not me?!

944
01:12:35,393 --> 01:12:37,634
I'm going to make it so...

945
01:12:38,688 --> 01:12:39,974
...you'll never betray me again!

946
01:12:43,401 --> 01:12:44,607
<i>Hinata...</i>

947
01:12:45,319 --> 01:12:48,653
<i>This big idiot finally understands...</i>

948
01:12:49,657 --> 01:12:55,653
<i>The meaning of the scarf you gave me</i>
<i>when you went to Toneri.</i>

949
01:12:57,456 --> 01:13:00,619
<i>I know now...from the scarf</i>
<i>you painstakingly knitted</i>

950
01:13:00,668 --> 01:13:02,830
<i>and took so long to finish,</i>

951
01:13:02,879 --> 01:13:06,417
<i>that your love can't be</i>
<i>unraveled so easily.</i>

952
01:13:15,182 --> 01:13:16,422
<i>Naruto...</i>

953
01:13:19,020 --> 01:13:20,931
<i>Wait for me...</i>

954
01:13:21,022 --> 01:13:25,687
<i>You've loved someone</i>
<i>like me for an eternity...</i>

955
01:13:26,402 --> 01:13:29,269
<i>Now, as a man, there's something</i>
<i>I've got to say to you...</i>

956
01:13:35,411 --> 01:13:39,075
Hinata... I swear I'll save you!

957
01:14:22,792 --> 01:14:25,534
Lord Raikage, the Chakra Cannons
are ready!

958
01:14:26,045 --> 01:14:29,128
All right!
Men... Load the chakra!

959
01:14:29,173 --> 01:14:30,129
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

960
01:14:30,257 --> 01:14:33,249
First, we'll fire the Chakra Diffusion
Cannon to pulverize the meteorites!

961
01:14:33,552 --> 01:14:35,463
Pulverize! Powderize!

962
01:15:02,123 --> 01:15:03,204
I need assistance!

963
01:15:03,290 --> 01:15:04,121
You got it!

964
01:15:04,375 --> 01:15:05,490
Rasen Shuriken!

965
01:15:11,298 --> 01:15:12,663
Kagemane no Jutsu! (Shadow Paralysis Jutsu)

966
01:15:18,431 --> 01:15:19,592
Next!

967
01:15:21,308 --> 01:15:22,844
We're storming the citadel!

968
01:15:22,893 --> 01:15:23,553
Right!

969
01:15:31,694 --> 01:15:32,650
Sakura!

970
01:15:41,495 --> 01:15:42,701
Thanks, Naruto!

971
01:15:42,830 --> 01:15:44,366
No need to thank me.

972
01:15:44,707 --> 01:15:47,540
I owe you big time,
and I'll never be able to repay you.

973
01:15:53,674 --> 01:15:55,039
What a drag!

974
01:15:57,928 --> 01:15:58,884
Why hide it?

975
01:15:59,013 --> 01:16:02,426
It's irritating, and prevents me
from making wise decisions.

976
01:16:06,854 --> 01:16:09,471
Naruto! Can you sense
Hanabi's chakra?

977
01:16:12,860 --> 01:16:14,567
Hanabi is in that tower over there!

978
01:16:14,653 --> 01:16:16,894
Sakura, Sai!
Take care of Hanabi!

979
01:16:17,031 --> 01:16:18,021
- Right!
- Right!

980
01:16:46,685 --> 01:16:47,925
Hinata!

981
01:16:48,562 --> 01:16:49,848
You bastard!

982
01:16:56,904 --> 01:16:59,191
Your fists will never reach me.

983
01:17:02,076 --> 01:17:03,282
Naruto! Where's Hinata?!

984
01:17:03,661 --> 01:17:04,617
In there!

985
01:17:07,414 --> 01:17:08,870
I'll handle things here.

986
01:17:08,916 --> 01:17:09,872
Thanks!

987
01:17:12,878 --> 01:17:13,709
Move!

988
01:17:17,258 --> 01:17:19,625
Whoa, I won't let you pass.

989
01:17:20,219 --> 01:17:22,961
All right, the puppet show
begins now!

990
01:17:25,766 --> 01:17:26,756
Hanabi is above here!

991
01:17:31,939 --> 01:17:32,679
What?

992
01:17:39,905 --> 01:17:40,645
This way?

993
01:17:42,449 --> 01:17:43,314
<i>Hinata!</i>

994
01:17:52,126 --> 01:17:53,992
Fūton! Kūsa Bōheki!
(Wind Style! Sky Sand Defensive Wall)

995
01:18:04,471 --> 01:18:06,462
At six o'clock! It's a huge one!

996
01:18:06,807 --> 01:18:08,673
Everyone! Crane Wing Formation!

997
01:18:08,726 --> 01:18:09,591
- Roger!
- Roger!

998
01:18:19,778 --> 01:18:21,439
The Sixth Gate of Joy...

999
01:18:25,701 --> 01:18:26,691
Damn it!

1000
01:18:45,512 --> 01:18:46,502
You're—!

1001
01:18:48,641 --> 01:18:50,257
If he's not around...

1002
01:18:50,726 --> 01:18:52,637
The only one who can protect
the village...

1003
01:18:53,437 --> 01:18:54,552
is me.

1004
01:18:57,524 --> 01:18:58,730
<i>Sasuke!</i>

1005
01:18:59,693 --> 01:19:01,024
The meteorites are gone!

1006
01:19:01,862 --> 01:19:02,727
Lord Hokage!

1007
01:19:02,821 --> 01:19:03,652
What is it?

1008
01:19:05,699 --> 01:19:06,734
Hiashi!

1009
01:19:07,409 --> 01:19:07,864
074

1010
01:19:07,910 --> 01:19:10,322
075

1011
01:19:08,285 --> 01:19:10,409
Chakra capacity at 75%.

1012
01:19:11,455 --> 01:19:14,117
76...77...

1013
01:19:17,878 --> 01:19:19,368
One after the other!

1014
01:19:29,139 --> 01:19:30,504
Go in.

1015
01:19:33,269 --> 01:19:34,225
Hinata!

1016
01:19:34,770 --> 01:19:36,602
What did you do?!

1017
01:19:36,647 --> 01:19:37,933
Give Hinata back!

1018
01:19:38,148 --> 01:19:41,266
Fine. I shall give her back to you.

1019
01:19:48,450 --> 01:19:49,611
Stop, Hinata!

1020
01:19:51,161 --> 01:19:54,119
What do you think of
my wife's skills?

1021
01:19:55,040 --> 01:19:55,950
Damn it!

1022
01:19:58,711 --> 01:20:00,293
<i>He's controlling her!</i>

1023
01:20:03,090 --> 01:20:04,125
<i>Hinata...</i>

1024
01:20:04,216 --> 01:20:06,253
<i>Bear with it for just a while!</i>

1025
01:20:17,062 --> 01:20:19,679
Don't you dare manipulate Hinata!

1026
01:20:20,858 --> 01:20:24,067
Hinata belongs to me.
I'm taking her back.

1027
01:20:28,907 --> 01:20:29,897
Hinata!

1028
01:20:30,367 --> 01:20:31,323
Begone!

1029
01:20:36,915 --> 01:20:37,950
Bastard...

1030
01:20:42,921 --> 01:20:44,582
It's too early to wake up.

1031
01:20:49,011 --> 01:20:51,378
Damn... The final pulsation?!

1032
01:20:59,855 --> 01:21:00,845
Naruto!

1033
01:21:01,357 --> 01:21:02,222
Hinata!

1034
01:21:03,067 --> 01:21:06,230
I'm so sorry, Naruto. I...

1035
01:21:06,320 --> 01:21:08,778
I understand,
so don't say anything.

1036
01:21:09,073 --> 01:21:10,859
I'm the one who has to apologize.

1037
01:21:11,742 --> 01:21:12,857
But what about him?

1038
01:21:13,160 --> 01:21:14,195
Now's our chance.

1039
01:21:14,828 --> 01:21:16,364
We have to destroy the Tenseigan!

1040
01:21:17,081 --> 01:21:18,037
Tenseigan?

1041
01:21:23,504 --> 01:21:24,494
Hanabi!

1042
01:21:25,839 --> 01:21:26,795
How terrible!

1043
01:21:26,965 --> 01:21:28,171
She's just a child...

1044
01:21:35,391 --> 01:21:36,597
Hinata...

1045
01:21:40,521 --> 01:21:43,229
If we destroy this, the moon
should stop its approach.

1046
01:21:43,440 --> 01:21:45,681
Got it. I'll use my Rasengan.

1047
01:21:45,734 --> 01:21:46,439
No!

1048
01:21:47,152 --> 01:21:49,564
There is a Cursed Jutsu cast
upon this eye.

1049
01:21:50,114 --> 01:21:52,572
Only someone with Hamura's blood
can touch it.

1050
01:21:52,658 --> 01:21:54,114
Anyone else will get
their chakra extracted.

1051
01:21:54,201 --> 01:21:55,066
What?

1052
01:22:03,836 --> 01:22:06,294
Hakke Sōjishi Hōgeki!
(Eight Trigrams Twin Lion Surging Shot)

1053
01:22:20,894 --> 01:22:22,430
I can't destroy it...

1054
01:22:29,403 --> 01:22:32,270
Hinata! Infuse me with your chakra!

1055
01:22:32,364 --> 01:22:33,104
Huh?

1056
01:22:33,740 --> 01:22:36,448
Then we might be able
to break it apart!

1057
01:22:39,204 --> 01:22:39,989
Okay!

1058
01:22:44,418 --> 01:22:45,249
Let's go!

1059
01:22:45,627 --> 01:22:46,492
Okay!

1060
01:23:15,449 --> 01:23:16,405
These are...

1061
01:23:16,700 --> 01:23:20,785
The Tenseigan was
a cluster of Byakugan?

1062
01:23:40,557 --> 01:23:41,672
What?!

1063
01:24:02,496 --> 01:24:03,406
Lord Hokage!

1064
01:24:03,705 --> 01:24:05,195
The moon has stopped its approach!

1065
01:24:05,499 --> 01:24:06,364
What?!

1066
01:24:09,586 --> 01:24:11,793
Chakra capacity at 95%!

1067
01:24:12,673 --> 01:24:16,837
96...97...98...99

1068
01:24:17,052 --> 01:24:18,133
MAXIMUM CHAKRA

1069
01:24:18,220 --> 01:24:20,257
Chakra is at 100%!

1070
01:24:20,514 --> 01:24:22,551
Chakra Diffusion Cannon... Fire!

1071
01:24:22,683 --> 01:24:23,718
Yeah!

1072
01:24:48,125 --> 01:24:49,240
What just happened?

1073
01:24:50,377 --> 01:24:52,243
An urgent message from
the Cloud Village!

1074
01:24:52,379 --> 01:24:54,040
A Five Kage Summit
is being convened!

1075
01:24:55,007 --> 01:24:56,918
<i>All the meteorites</i>
<i>have been destroyed.</i>

1076
01:24:57,092 --> 01:24:59,550
<i>So you had such a weapon</i>
<i>like that hidden away?</i>

1077
01:24:59,595 --> 01:25:02,337
<i>It seems we cannot be</i>
<i>too careful with you, Raikage...</i>

1078
01:25:02,389 --> 01:25:04,756
<i>Lord Tsuchikage,</i>
<i>let's forget the sarcasm!</i>

1079
01:25:05,392 --> 01:25:07,429
<i>Next up is the Chakra</i>
<i>Transportation Cannon.</i>

1080
01:25:07,477 --> 01:25:08,933
<i>We'll blow up the moon!</i>

1081
01:25:09,062 --> 01:25:10,644
Blow up the moon?!

1082
01:25:16,069 --> 01:25:17,309
What's happening?

1083
01:25:18,322 --> 01:25:19,107
Shikamaru!

1084
01:25:20,407 --> 01:25:22,364
Hinata! Are you all right?

1085
01:25:23,285 --> 01:25:25,367
Yes... I'm sorry.

1086
01:25:26,079 --> 01:25:27,535
Save that for later.

1087
01:25:28,457 --> 01:25:32,416
Anyway, what happened?
The artificial sun disappeared.

1088
01:25:32,919 --> 01:25:34,660
We destroyed the Tenseigan.

1089
01:25:34,755 --> 01:25:37,122
It was the source of power
for everything.

1090
01:25:37,507 --> 01:25:38,997
The moon should have
stopped moving too.

1091
01:25:39,259 --> 01:25:40,090
What?!

1092
01:25:48,477 --> 01:25:52,220
My entire clan sacrificed
their eyes for this treasure.

1093
01:25:52,272 --> 01:25:54,013
The Otsutsuki Treasure...

1094
01:25:54,608 --> 01:25:55,689
How dare they!

1095
01:25:56,943 --> 01:25:58,149
Hanabi!

1096
01:25:59,112 --> 01:26:00,147
Thank you!

1097
01:26:00,989 --> 01:26:02,650
This is...yours, right?

1098
01:26:05,869 --> 01:26:06,825
Uh-huh.

1099
01:26:07,621 --> 01:26:12,161
Isn't that the scarf that
Toneri ripped off?

1100
01:26:13,543 --> 01:26:14,829
How did you know?

1101
01:26:15,045 --> 01:26:17,787
When I pulled Toneri's jutsu
from your body...

1102
01:26:18,298 --> 01:26:20,505
I was able to see your memories.

1103
01:26:21,051 --> 01:26:23,088
You were going to give it
to Naruto, right?

1104
01:26:28,308 --> 01:26:30,424
Did you make it for me?

1105
01:26:31,478 --> 01:26:33,389
U...Uh-huh...

1106
01:26:34,147 --> 01:26:36,684
Can I have it?

1107
01:26:37,693 --> 01:26:40,310
But...it's in shreds.

1108
01:26:41,571 --> 01:26:42,606
I don't care.

1109
01:26:43,907 --> 01:26:47,116
I mean...I want it.

1110
01:27:02,968 --> 01:27:04,379
Thank you.

1111
01:27:08,348 --> 01:27:09,634
I'll cherish it.

1112
01:27:14,438 --> 01:27:15,553
Naruto...

1113
01:27:20,861 --> 01:27:22,067
What's the matter?

1114
01:27:22,738 --> 01:27:23,899
The clock...

1115
01:27:25,031 --> 01:27:25,896
It's moving.

1116
01:27:26,199 --> 01:27:27,189
- Huh?!
- Huh?!

1117
01:27:30,120 --> 01:27:33,579
With these eyes, Naruto...

1118
01:27:34,040 --> 01:27:38,375
I'll destroy your world!

1119
01:27:41,381 --> 01:27:44,089
<i>It's too dangerous to</i>
<i>blow up the moon!</i>

1120
01:27:44,217 --> 01:27:47,335
<i>As long as the moon is a bomb</i>

1121
01:27:47,637 --> 01:27:50,174
<i>the Earth will not be safe!</i>

1122
01:27:50,640 --> 01:27:52,551
Now, let's discuss this calmly.

1123
01:27:52,851 --> 01:27:55,013
Right now, the moon has
stopped its approach.

1124
01:27:55,228 --> 01:27:57,560
<i>No... It hasn't stopped.</i>

1125
01:27:58,231 --> 01:27:58,936
What?

1126
01:28:03,987 --> 01:28:06,228
Why is the clock ticking again?!

1127
01:28:06,281 --> 01:28:07,396
I don't know.

1128
01:28:13,038 --> 01:28:13,823
W...What was that?

1129
01:28:34,851 --> 01:28:36,512
Kurama!

1130
01:29:15,809 --> 01:29:16,549
Kurama!

1131
01:29:17,978 --> 01:29:19,013
It's Toneri!

1132
01:29:33,994 --> 01:29:35,405
Ginrin Tensei Baku!
(Silver Wheel Rebirth Explosion)

1133
01:29:56,391 --> 01:29:56,846
089

1134
01:29:56,892 --> 01:29:57,882
090

1135
01:29:57,976 --> 01:30:00,013
Chakra capacity at 90%!

1136
01:30:00,729 --> 01:30:01,719
Lord Hokage...

1137
01:30:01,938 --> 01:30:04,054
Hiashi would like a word with you.

1138
01:30:04,357 --> 01:30:05,313
Hiashi?!

1139
01:30:07,360 --> 01:30:10,648
Do not destroy the moon.

1140
01:30:11,489 --> 01:30:14,698
I'm certain that Hanabi and
Hinata are on the moon.

1141
01:30:14,951 --> 01:30:16,692
What do you mean by that?!

1142
01:30:17,203 --> 01:30:18,238
Bad news!

1143
01:30:18,330 --> 01:30:19,070
What is it?

1144
01:30:19,164 --> 01:30:20,780
The Nine Tails is
on the moon's surface!

1145
01:30:20,874 --> 01:30:21,579
What?!

1146
01:30:50,445 --> 01:30:50,934
094

1147
01:30:50,987 --> 01:30:51,943
095

1148
01:30:52,030 --> 01:30:54,237
Chakra capacity at 95%.

1149
01:30:55,325 --> 01:30:57,783
Lord Raikage! An urgent message
from Lord Hokage!

1150
01:30:57,953 --> 01:30:59,864
What does he want
at this critical time?!

1151
01:31:00,705 --> 01:31:02,446
Please hold the Chakra Cannon.

1152
01:31:02,749 --> 01:31:04,205
Naruto and the others are on the moon.

1153
01:31:04,501 --> 01:31:05,832
<i>It can't be helped.</i>

1154
01:31:05,919 --> 01:31:08,581
<i>They have to be sacrificed for</i>
<i>the sake of humanity and the Earth!</i>

1155
01:31:08,630 --> 01:31:10,962
<i>We're going to fire</i>
<i>the Chakra Transportation Cannon!</i>

1156
01:31:11,508 --> 01:31:13,340
<i>- Lord Raikage.</i>
<i>- What is it?</i>

1157
01:31:13,677 --> 01:31:16,669
<i>I'm asking you as well.</i>
<i>Wait one hour.</i>

1158
01:31:16,888 --> 01:31:17,628
<i>What?!</i>

1159
01:31:17,722 --> 01:31:18,803
<i>I agree.</i>

1160
01:31:18,890 --> 01:31:19,971
<i>Mizukage!</i>

1161
01:31:20,058 --> 01:31:22,095
<i>Naruto is the hero</i>
<i>of the last Great War.</i>

1162
01:31:22,143 --> 01:31:24,054
<i>He's worth betting on...</i>

1163
01:31:24,479 --> 01:31:25,594
<i>Tsuchikage!</i>

1164
01:31:30,276 --> 01:31:31,516
Just one hour will do.

1165
01:31:32,445 --> 01:31:36,063
But for them, that amount of time
will be worth a lifetime

1166
01:31:36,116 --> 01:31:39,654
that can never be replaced.

1167
01:31:40,537 --> 01:31:41,823
<i>What do you base that on?</i>

1168
01:31:42,789 --> 01:31:44,826
A hunch.

1169
01:31:46,710 --> 01:31:48,371
Hinata, are you okay?

1170
01:31:48,628 --> 01:31:49,333
Uh-huh.

1171
01:31:52,007 --> 01:31:52,792
No!

1172
01:32:02,600 --> 01:32:04,090
I'm taking Hinata back.

1173
01:32:06,396 --> 01:32:08,353
You can watch his last moments...
from there!

1174
01:32:12,986 --> 01:32:14,021
Hinata!

1175
01:32:22,412 --> 01:32:23,527
Naruto!

1176
01:32:50,273 --> 01:32:53,106
The world created by
the Sage of Six Paths is a failure!

1177
01:32:53,943 --> 01:32:56,105
I'm destroying both
the Earth and you!

1178
01:33:00,450 --> 01:33:03,533
I won't let the Earth get destroyed!

1179
01:33:14,172 --> 01:33:15,458
Rasenrangan! (Rasen-Rampage)

1180
01:33:34,109 --> 01:33:35,895
Kinrin Tensei Baku!
(Golden Wheel Rebirth Explosion)

1181
01:33:38,363 --> 01:33:39,398
Naruto!

1182
01:33:56,881 --> 01:33:58,121
What is that?

1183
01:34:02,679 --> 01:34:03,544
The moon...

1184
01:34:03,721 --> 01:34:05,052
The moon has split apart!

1185
01:34:05,140 --> 01:34:06,175
What?!

1186
01:34:08,226 --> 01:34:09,682
What's happening?!

1187
01:34:10,436 --> 01:34:11,426
Hey, Hokage!

1188
01:34:11,604 --> 01:34:13,060
There's ten minutes left!

1189
01:34:16,943 --> 01:34:18,104
It's over...

1190
01:34:20,613 --> 01:34:22,820
It's not over!

1191
01:34:25,160 --> 01:34:26,116
What?!

1192
01:34:36,379 --> 01:34:38,666
Chōōdama... Rasen...

1193
01:34:38,756 --> 01:34:39,996
Tarengan! (Massive Rasengan Barrage)

1194
01:35:04,657 --> 01:35:07,069
It's useless... Give it up!

1195
01:35:07,619 --> 01:35:09,075
Like I'd give up!

1196
01:35:09,662 --> 01:35:12,154
It takes time to knit a scarf.

1197
01:35:12,624 --> 01:35:14,456
The deeper the feelings
you want to convey,

1198
01:35:14,500 --> 01:35:17,788
the longer it takes to knit!

1199
01:35:19,130 --> 01:35:21,087
It's over now!

1200
01:35:28,514 --> 01:35:30,596
Like I'd let you!

1201
01:35:31,684 --> 01:35:33,391
To convey one's feelings...

1202
01:35:33,436 --> 01:35:36,974
It takes much...much more time!

1203
01:35:37,815 --> 01:35:38,896
That's why...

1204
01:35:39,359 --> 01:35:43,569
I can't let it end...so easily!

1205
01:36:00,338 --> 01:36:03,296
You got me with...one punch!

1206
01:36:05,635 --> 01:36:08,218
The Tenseigan is fading!

1207
01:36:14,560 --> 01:36:15,550
Huh?

1208
01:36:19,774 --> 01:36:20,764
Hinata!

1209
01:36:20,900 --> 01:36:21,935
Naruto!

1210
01:36:29,200 --> 01:36:31,612
I'm taking back Hanabi's eyes.

1211
01:36:32,287 --> 01:36:34,949
No... Stop!

1212
01:36:36,916 --> 01:36:37,906
Why you—!

1213
01:36:39,127 --> 01:36:41,289
This is over.

1214
01:36:42,922 --> 01:36:43,912
Not yet!

1215
01:36:48,177 --> 01:36:49,633
Sakura, are you okay?

1216
01:36:50,430 --> 01:36:51,386
What about Naruto and the others?

1217
01:36:51,931 --> 01:36:53,046
I don't know.

1218
01:36:57,478 --> 01:36:59,685
W...What's going on?

1219
01:37:05,361 --> 01:37:08,353
I'll end it all with these eyes!

1220
01:37:09,157 --> 01:37:10,522
Puppet Rebirth!

1221
01:37:16,622 --> 01:37:18,158
You're annoying!

1222
01:37:24,255 --> 01:37:25,120
Naruto!

1223
01:37:25,465 --> 01:37:26,546
Hinata!

1224
01:37:28,718 --> 01:37:30,254
Toneri, please stop already!

1225
01:37:30,636 --> 01:37:33,674
All you did was follow
your ancestor's misguided teachings.

1226
01:37:33,973 --> 01:37:38,012
Quiet! As the last survivor
of the Otsutsuki Clan,

1227
01:37:38,394 --> 01:37:41,352
I must fulfill Hamura's Celestial Decree!

1228
01:37:43,816 --> 01:37:45,022
Naruto!

1229
01:37:47,153 --> 01:37:50,737
All my chakra's being sucked out...

1230
01:37:52,992 --> 01:37:54,778
You'll now witness the power
of Hamura...

1231
01:37:54,827 --> 01:37:56,238
a power that can move the moon!

1232
01:37:56,996 --> 01:37:59,533
Naruto! It's over for you!

1233
01:38:05,088 --> 01:38:06,249
Hinata?

1234
01:38:13,096 --> 01:38:14,052
What?!

1235
01:38:14,389 --> 01:38:16,551
I won't let it end yet!

1236
01:38:16,724 --> 01:38:17,885
Why?!

1237
01:38:18,059 --> 01:38:21,142
Hamura's chakra flows within me too!

1238
01:38:21,396 --> 01:38:22,807
Stop already!

1239
01:38:24,273 --> 01:38:28,642
End it... End the world of
the Sage of Six Paths...!

1240
01:38:33,991 --> 01:38:37,200
I will destroy the Sage's world,
that has fallen into darkness...

1241
01:38:37,245 --> 01:38:39,407
with the light of justice!

1242
01:39:04,564 --> 01:39:05,429
What?!

1243
01:39:05,481 --> 01:39:08,564
His jutsu absorbed the sun's energy...

1244
01:39:08,734 --> 01:39:10,941
and now, he's exceeded the limits of his chakra.

1245
01:39:20,413 --> 01:39:21,448
Naruto!

1246
01:39:22,415 --> 01:39:23,780
Don't! It's too dangerous!

1247
01:39:29,130 --> 01:39:30,291
Time's up.

1248
01:39:30,756 --> 01:39:32,793
Fire the Chakra Transportation Cannon!

1249
01:39:36,429 --> 01:39:37,385
What's wrong?!

1250
01:39:37,763 --> 01:39:39,925
I can't shoot at Naruto.

1251
01:39:40,349 --> 01:39:41,635
Stifle your personal feelings!

1252
01:39:41,767 --> 01:39:44,054
The very existence of Earth
depends on this!

1253
01:39:45,438 --> 01:39:47,270
Move! I'll fire it!

1254
01:39:47,440 --> 01:39:49,522
Lord Raikage!
There is some writing on the moon!

1255
01:39:49,775 --> 01:39:50,981
What?!

1256
01:39:51,944 --> 01:39:54,151
Kurama is writing something
on the moon's surface.

1257
01:39:54,280 --> 01:39:55,145
What?

1258
01:39:59,160 --> 01:40:00,491
That shinobi letter means...

1259
01:40:01,370 --> 01:40:02,485
Mission accomplished!

1260
01:40:03,080 --> 01:40:04,320
The mission was successful!

1261
01:40:05,166 --> 01:40:06,156
I see...

1262
01:40:11,797 --> 01:40:14,084
Emergency announcement
to the entire world!

1263
01:40:14,175 --> 01:40:15,665
The moon has stopped!

1264
01:40:16,177 --> 01:40:19,511
Thanks to the efforts
of these five...

1265
01:40:19,555 --> 01:40:23,514
Shikamaru, Sakura, Sai,
Hinata, and Naruto...

1266
01:40:23,559 --> 01:40:26,597
Earth and the future of Earth
is safe!

1267
01:40:27,939 --> 01:40:31,432
My hunches...
usually end on a high note.

1268
01:40:34,820 --> 01:40:36,731
Making me write letters...

1269
01:40:37,323 --> 01:40:39,485
I'm bad at calligraphy.

1270
01:40:39,659 --> 01:40:40,990
Sorry, Kurama.

1271
01:40:49,627 --> 01:40:50,583
T...This is...

1272
01:40:51,379 --> 01:40:54,872
Hamura's soul guided me here...

1273
01:41:01,430 --> 01:41:05,389
Toneri... Everyone on Earth
will welcome you...

1274
01:41:06,394 --> 01:41:09,102
I will remain on the moon
and atone for my sins.

1275
01:41:11,566 --> 01:41:12,476
Toneri...

1276
01:41:13,484 --> 01:41:16,067
One day...
One day, come to Earth!

1277
01:41:18,864 --> 01:41:22,323
The moon will never approach Earth...

1278
01:41:23,828 --> 01:41:24,818
Never again.

1279
01:41:31,627 --> 01:41:35,086
Naruto, there's something
I have to ask you.

1280
01:41:35,423 --> 01:41:36,458
What is it?

1281
01:41:36,882 --> 01:41:39,249
That scarf...

1282
01:41:39,760 --> 01:41:41,000
Who gave it to you?

1283
01:41:41,304 --> 01:41:43,261
Oh, this...

1284
01:41:44,390 --> 01:41:47,303
My late mom made it for me.

1285
01:41:47,518 --> 01:41:48,599
What?

1286
01:41:49,228 --> 01:41:51,765
<i>My grandpa must've kept it for her.</i>

1287
01:41:52,732 --> 01:41:53,847
<i>Mom...!</i>

1288
01:41:54,650 --> 01:41:55,890
I see...

1289
01:41:56,110 --> 01:41:57,396
I'm so silly...

1290
01:41:57,445 --> 01:41:59,402
Hey, Elder Sister!

1291
01:41:59,447 --> 01:42:02,860
How long are you going to chitchat?
I'm going on ahead of you.

1292
01:42:03,117 --> 01:42:06,155
Hurry up. The passageway is
starting to disintegrate.

1293
01:42:09,081 --> 01:42:10,788
Let's go home to Earth.

1294
01:42:11,709 --> 01:42:12,494
Yes.

1295
01:42:30,227 --> 01:42:31,183
Hinata...

1296
01:42:31,312 --> 01:42:32,302
Yes?

1297
01:42:32,605 --> 01:42:35,097
Back in school,
when we were asked

1298
01:42:35,149 --> 01:42:37,265
who we'd want to spend
our last day on Earth with...

1299
01:42:37,318 --> 01:42:39,980
I couldn't write anyone's name down.

1300
01:42:40,488 --> 01:42:43,321
I didn't know my parents...
and I didn't have any friends...

1301
01:42:44,241 --> 01:42:47,825
But now,
I know exactly who I'd choose.

1302
01:42:48,788 --> 01:42:51,405
I want to stay with you.

1303
01:42:52,166 --> 01:42:55,875
Now and forever, until I die...

1304
01:42:57,463 --> 01:42:59,124
I want to be with you Hinata.

1305
01:43:01,258 --> 01:43:02,498
<i>Naruto...</i>

1306
01:44:44,653 --> 01:44:45,609
Naruto...

1307
01:44:46,322 --> 01:44:48,188
Hinata, put your arms around me.

1308
01:44:48,240 --> 01:44:48,900
Huh?

1309
01:44:49,700 --> 01:44:51,282
O...Okay...

1310
01:44:53,579 --> 01:44:54,785
Don't let go okay?

1311
01:44:56,707 --> 01:44:57,742
I won't.

1312
01:45:01,253 --> 01:45:03,711
<i>I'll never, ever let go...</i>

1313
01:45:07,384 --> 01:45:08,840
Huh? What are you doing?

1314
01:45:16,811 --> 01:45:17,721
Elder Sister!

1315
01:45:17,770 --> 01:45:20,307
Naruto! You're going to crash
into the ceiling!

1316
01:45:20,606 --> 01:45:22,893
Like I'm going to let it stop here!

1317
01:45:38,499 --> 01:45:39,489
Hinata...

1318
01:45:40,292 --> 01:45:41,248
Naruto...

1319
01:46:00,229 --> 01:46:02,846
<i>Thank you, Hinata...</i>

1320
01:46:43,814 --> 01:46:48,809
<i>Why, oh why are we born crying</i>

1321
01:46:48,861 --> 01:46:54,573
<i>then cry through life and turn into stars?</i>

1322
01:46:54,909 --> 01:47:00,325
<i>Why, oh why</i>
<i>do we know how to shed tears</i>

1323
01:47:00,372 --> 01:47:06,334
<i>without anyone ever teaching us?</i>

1324
01:47:06,670 --> 01:47:11,255
<i>The tears that run down your cheeks</i>

1325
01:47:12,676 --> 01:47:17,466
<i>are proof of a never-ending love</i>

1326
01:47:18,557 --> 01:47:24,269
<i>It's guided me gently,</i>

1327
01:47:25,230 --> 01:47:29,565
<i>and slowly I've come to realize it</i>

1328
01:47:33,405 --> 01:47:36,943
<i>From the heart to the body,</i>

1329
01:47:37,117 --> 01:47:39,449
<i>from the body to the heart</i>

1330
01:47:39,995 --> 01:47:45,707
<i>The spiral shapes that intertwine</i>
<i>and extend</i>

1331
01:47:45,751 --> 01:47:51,167
<i>If we can see our future in each one,</i>

1332
01:47:51,757 --> 01:47:59,175
<i>even this sky we gaze at...</i>
<i>will look like the universe</i>

1333
01:48:09,650 --> 01:48:14,440
<i>Why, oh why...</i>
<i>does the moon always</i>

1334
01:48:14,738 --> 01:48:20,324
<i>illuminate the darkness in silence?</i>

1335
01:48:20,828 --> 01:48:26,164
<i>Why, oh why...</i>
<i>do we waste our heartbeats</i>

1336
01:48:26,583 --> 01:48:32,124
<i>knowing that there is a limit to them?</i>

1337
01:48:32,673 --> 01:48:43,175
<i>Instead of judging the value of things</i>
<i>we embrace, by their size</i>

1338
01:48:44,351 --> 01:48:55,274
<i>I want to be able to feel "life"</i>
<i>through its passionate stories</i>

1339
01:48:59,324 --> 01:49:05,195
<i>No matter how hard I strain</i>
<i>to see myself</i>

1340
01:49:05,789 --> 01:49:11,455
<i>It's fuzzy and hard to see,</i>
<i>and soon I lose sight all together</i>

1341
01:49:11,503 --> 01:49:16,919
<i>If the more I search,</i>
<i>the more confused I'll get...</i>

1342
01:49:17,676 --> 01:49:21,635
<i>I can learn by example</i>

1343
01:49:22,222 --> 01:49:25,510
<i>Yes, I can make it my own</i>

1344
01:49:40,866 --> 01:49:45,485
<i>To live must mean</i>

1345
01:49:46,705 --> 01:49:51,199
<i>to slowly let go</i>

1346
01:49:52,628 --> 01:49:58,715
<i>And at that final moment,</i>

1347
01:49:59,259 --> 01:50:01,591
<i>I want someone near,</i>

1348
01:50:04,515 --> 01:50:09,430
<i>who will shed tears...</i>

1349
01:50:10,354 --> 01:50:13,221
<i>And I'll be happy</i>

1350
01:50:13,440 --> 01:50:16,432
<i>From the heart to the body,</i>

1351
01:50:17,027 --> 01:50:19,610
<i>from the body to the heart</i>

1352
01:50:19,863 --> 01:50:25,529
<i>Continuous spirals that are passed on</i>
<i>and extend</i>

1353
01:50:25,577 --> 01:50:31,118
<i>When we can believe that</i>
<i>this repetition is for eternity,</i>

1354
01:50:31,917 --> 01:50:39,335
<i>everything we see before us...</i>
<i>will look like the universe</i>

1355
01:50:42,302 --> 01:50:44,794
<i>Like the universe</i>

1356
01:51:29,308 --> 01:51:31,465
Daddy!

1357
01:51:32,102 --> 01:51:33,558
Play with us!

1358
01:51:35,731 --> 01:51:38,314
Hey, don't go outside in your bare feet!

1359
01:51:38,984 --> 01:51:40,725
All right, Boruto! Himawari!

1360
01:51:40,903 --> 01:51:41,893
How about a snowball fight!

1361
01:51:41,987 --> 01:51:43,273
- A snowball fight?
- A snowball fight?

1362
01:51:44,323 --> 01:51:45,279
Take that!

1363
01:51:45,824 --> 01:51:47,030
Hey, Boruto!

1364
01:51:47,117 --> 01:51:49,358
All right, you asked for it!

1365
01:51:49,536 --> 01:51:50,526
- Yay!
- Yay!

1366
01:51:50,621 --> 01:51:54,489
Hey, you know when Mom
gets serious, she's super strong!
